{"_id":"3JTOKwWtAPnMlrM8","name":"Rebel Cell Leader","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Leaders of individual Rebel cells are similar in many ways to Alliance commanders, although they have fewer resources, fewer personnel, and, some might argue, take vastly greater risks. These men and women operate inside enemy lines, attempting to undermine the Empire’s interests and foment dissent against its rule. The environments in which these cells operate are spectacularly hostile toward any form of rebellion, and capture invariably results in death. Typically the acts of a Rebel cell involve espionage and sabotage. It is necessary for Rebel cells to maintain a low profile in order to avoid drawing too much scrutiny to themselves; bringing the attention of the Imperials down upon the local populace is a good way to alienate potential recruits and tarnish the reputation of the Alliance as a whole."}},"items":[{"_id":"x7ts2d3bGCnpZ0fU","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"jBgaLrdQXu09xDlH","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"BbPUvJl4eSNU2J0w","name":"Fire bomb","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Blast 7, Burn 2, Innacurate 1, Limited Ammo 1"}},{"_id":"chlsrpSLOfKIpow0","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"a0vibQEXu6rZorC0","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
