{"_id":"3hLRtcBRuakyuZKr","name":"Preelos Consortium Customised Security Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These droids are deployed throughout the mansion and normally they are quite effective in maintaining security. When faced with the superior firepower that the Gorensla enforcers bring to bear at the start of their brash attack, however, they are little more than a distraction. On the other hand, later on, as the Gorensla forces are thinned, these droids could help turn the tide."}},"items":[{"_id":"bo34kF0bHnnjOLfL","name":"Built-in blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"8m46peMfZBspVHsI","name":"Net gun","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Ensnare 3, Knockdown, Limited Ammo 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"3jqw1KFyZSOlV4Es","name":"Weequay Thug","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Weequay are a harsh and resilient species who often find themselves used as enforcers because of their thick, toughened skin and dense bone structure. Their culture idealizes violence and conflict, and has a long history of working as mercenaries for factions all across the galaxy. They perform well in this role, tending to stay quiet and solitary, blending into the background whether working on a pirate crew or in a Hutt’s throne room."}},"items":[{"_id":"6eljg6eyFlfaSW9X","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"mWKuNWZx2rvXF4rJ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
