{"_id":"3sioTvS6ixR3AMyL","name":"Terentatek (d20radio)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The nightmarish terentatek are hulking creatures, similar in appearance to rancors but covered in spines and thick armoured hide. Drawn to, and perhaps powered by, concentrations of dark side Force energy, terentateks inhabit caves and tombs connected to dark side Force traditions such as the Sith and Rakata.  Over the millennia, the Jedi have launched the Great Hunts. These hunts were concerted efforts to wipe out the scourge of these beasts by dispatching teams of trained Jedi across the galaxy. However, even where the Jedi cleansed entire worlds the terentatek would return generations later. Jedi scholars believe the terentatek enter hibernation and hiding when the dark side wanes in the galaxy, only to awaken and emerge in times of conflict and suffering. Despite their horrifying reputation, bold treasure hunters often seek out reports of terentatek sightings in hope that the beasts are evidence of undiscovered tombs and therefore unclaimed riches. Even when no tomb is present the lair of a terentatek may contain the remains, and equipment, of warriors such as the Jedi who died in battle against these beasts."}},"items":[{"_id":"WGvStG3M4P2eYUjO","name":"Massive claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":15,"critical":3,"range":"Short","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare, Knockdown"}},{"_id":"rIZosqqIZYyVyZqT","name":"Goring tusks","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 5, Inaccurate 2"}},{"_id":"mbe3tYgYnrHzlkiX","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
