{"_id":"5Ba5GKd7RITJSqnk","name":"M-3PO-Series Military Protocol Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Technically classified as a protocol droid, the M-3PO-series was never intended to assist in negotiations or cultural exchanges. An M-3PO military protocol droid manages logistical and analytical efforts for soldiers. Its chassis is better protected than a typical protocol droid, and it is programmed for military discipline in all situations. However, the M-3PO-series cannot withstand the rigours of actual combat. An M-3PO unit is best deployed inside a secure installation where it can access tactical data or manage communications. The droid uses its encyclopaedic knowledge of military protocols, tactics and doctrines to assist nearby personnel. A commander with an M-3PO advisor gains the edge of keen, dispassionate logic, while a quartermaster assisted by a similar aide always knows how to efficiently supply troops. M-3PO units are sticklers for obeying whatever regulations apply to the group they are serving, and they are notoriously inflexible."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5CjRm7YtnbZnI83x","name":"Boma","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"02Om0WGCyqfLLysL","name":"Brawl","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5EumyvbU5jTeQ51e","name":"Field Biology Expert","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per session as an action, when facing an enemy beast with the Adversary talent, Dr Boll may roll a :hard: Xenology check with the difficulty upgraded by the creature’s ranks in Adversary. Success reduces Adversary rank for all creatures of that type by 1 (to a minimum of 0) for the remainder of the encounter."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5HJBI3MRIdm7j425","name":"Stormtrooper: Mimban Stormtrooper","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"While not an official specialty corps, those stormtroopers assigned Mimban duty quickly developed equipment modifications and unique tactics. An integral part of the 224th Imperial Armoured Division, these “Mimban stormtroopers” were considered by their commanders to be far more effective and reliable than their more humble mudtrooper brethren. As a result, the 224th’s commanders often combined mass numbers of mudtroopers with smaller detachments of stormtroopers. Stormtroopers served as an anchor for the less than reliable mudtroopers, while the mudtrooper’s superior numbers provided the stormtroopers a human shield."}},"items":[{"_id":"MsfDdtrJqqaBS0ss","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"uFT2YU3hGTnSe8Rk","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ictksBBRCNV4uZPV","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"RhQPHf52oImmFhMm","name":"E-22 blaster carbine","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Cumbersome 2, Linked 1, Stun Setting"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5KmDOUCt8nU2g34x","name":"Survival of the Fittest","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5QBbVKOC8LmQSGuX","name":"Belonuk (Young)","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The younger of the species refrain from charging individually, instead using swarm tactics to overwhelm their foes. They minimise their exposure to other predators by grabbing their prey and hiding them away as quickly as possible."}},"items":[{"_id":"eI6mRnRZTEYziRAE","name":"Teeth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 1"}},{"_id":"Pn3EYislQIt8Z53n","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5QdmPo7YNNbcAPMe","name":"Precise Aim","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per round, may perform a Precise Aim maneuver to suffer up to {ranks} Strain to reduce target’s melee and ranged defences by Strain spent."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5QmRrqvpTyaqFwWr","name":"Dynamic Fire","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When making a ranged attack while engaged with an opponent, the character may suffer 2 Strain to reduce the ranged modifier for being engaged by 1 for the attack."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5S3KxeHoIo1s2UTr","name":"Urban Security Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"With dark metal plating and slithering, mechanical tentacles, Sith urban security droids present a constant reminder that the state is always watching. A meter wide, roughly spherical body houses the droid’s primary systems. A series of multi spectrum photoreceptors adorns the outer shell, providing optimal surveillance capabilities. Beneath the main body hang four segmented arms, each equipped with a different sensor or manipulator. Imperial engineers designed the droids specifically to be unsettling to organics, an effect magnified by their tendency to float just above eye level.\n\nThese droids are omnipresent on the Sith Empire’s core worlds. Installations such as star ports, public transport, and government buildings are constantly monitored by these mechanical sentries. Imperial streets are patrolled at ground level by pairs of these droids. They maintain a wide spacing to prevent both units falling prey to ambush. Despite a lack of personality programming, imperial engineers have installed profiling directives, guiding these droids to suspect wrongdoing from alien species. Humans are treated neutrally, with pureblooded Sith being ignored almost entirely."}},"items":[{"_id":"CCcD4JNQwByleLUe","name":"Built-in blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5TaANMW7NC8EJPvU","name":"DZ-70 Fugitive Tracker Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The DZ-70 by Arakyd Industries is one of the most popular tracking droids on the market today. Used by militaries and law enforcement agencies throughout the galaxy, these small droids are not particularly bright but are expert trackers and are incredibly persistent in the pursuit of a target. Around two metres across, the DZ-70 is a small, spherical droid equipped with a powerful repulsorlift system that provides excellent agility and overland speed. The droid’s hull is studded with photoreceptors and assorted sensors that give it an unrestricted, 360 degree view of its surroundings. Two powerful, retractable claws are housed in covered bays along the droid’s bottom and it carries a blaster pistol and ion blaster as standard armament. While quite competent despite its low intelligence, a DZ-70’s natural zeal and tenaciousness may occasionally lead to the development of an “at all costs” metnatility if the droid isn’t given proper maintenance and regular memory wipes. This means that the droid does everything in its power, including the use of lethal force, to bring a fugitive to justice."}},"items":[{"_id":"TwlEQclT3fKrGAUS","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"j9ZkpG698Bg1agF4","name":"Ionisation blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":5,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Disorient 5, Stun Damage"}},{"_id":"ArIbS2p4y6mSpynS","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"LUHj692FIua4TZ2Y","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"5dXAc6Kf2ZgdX5ZB","name":"Shreya Ordassa, Togrutan Academic","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Shreya Ordassa stands out among the humanoid galagoers with her pale orange skin and gray-white facial markings. She often dresses in muted, neutral colours to minimize the difference in her appearance due to a lifetime of struggling with anti-alien prejudice. Still, her prominent back and white striped head-tails and the hollow horns of her species are distinctive, alien, and beautiful in their own way."}},"items":[{"_id":"W8uQ6i9poZWQM8Hn","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"haw4sM9XwJq9acYx","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
