{"_id":"5qxHr3B2FrJUqFE2","name":"Gank Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Ganks are a war-loving, bipedal species used by the Hutts and others as bounty hunters, mercenaries, and assassins. Although little is known about the species’ origins, the Ganks’ reputation as cold-blooded killers is well known across the galaxy. Ganks cover themselves from head to toe in battle armour, and they are rarely alone, preferring to work in packs. As to what Ganks look like under the armour and prosthetics, one would have to ask a Gank to find out—a daunting prospect. Almost all Ganks augment their bodies with cybernet ics, the better to accomplish their violent work."}},"items":[{"_id":"pnQRSI1XdLsskTcR","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"3wZajZ98pSu01Hb2","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"PAfRVFO8uf9Qir0g","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
