{"_id":"5uIwWY1CL9AVYuhR","name":"Corporate Representative","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"In the waning days of the Republic, many people were gravely concerned about the increasing power held by corporations. Many such corporations were afforded the rights of planetary governments, including seats within the Senate. Since the Republic gave way to the Empire, the problem has increased significantly, despite the defeat of the Separatists during the Clone Wars—though only with regard to those corporations that supported the Empire. Corporations with strong Imperial partnerships, particularly with the military, are virtually above the law, and their representatives tend to be viewed in the same way as ambassadors, diplomats, or even senators—albeit with vastly greater resources and a generally more menacing demeanour."}},"items":[{"_id":"jGPQNvLSacxdKpJK","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"BKgb5MURJByCIJtu","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
