{"_id":"8eL8WjDCGYYbJwNR","name":"Tunnel Worm","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Tunnel worms are immense, eyeless, ravenous worms raised by Selonians as both beasts of burden and a food source. Growing upwards of ten metres and weighing hundreds of kilogrammes, tunnel worms have smooth, glistening, limbless, mottled grey bodies that are dominated by a round, slavering mouth filled with saw-like teeth on one end and taper to a point at the other. Incredibly dim-witted, tunnel worms are instinct-driven creatures who live only to eat, grow and reproduce. Their diet consists of stones and a luminous fungus native to the Selonian tunnels. Their mynock-like mouths contain powerful olfactory sensors which differentiate between the faintest smells at great distances, and secrete a thick, powerful acid with the consistency of wet ferrocrete that sticks to everything. Given enough time, the sticky acid can reduce nearly any material to sludge.\n\nWhen left to their own devices, tunnel worms trundle through the Selonian den complexes eating fungus, debris, and filth. They keep the tunnels clean and occasionally burrow new tunnels or excavate long lost dens in their constant search for food. They are difficulty to provoke, but once angered, they spit their caustic saliva and lash about with their tails until the threat is melted or pummelled into submission."}},"items":[{"_id":"N50DsXdtCNA7Bb1f","name":"Serrated maw","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Burn 4, Sunder, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"Qj88T5fI3IqExeUC","name":"Crushing tail","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Concussive 3, Knockdown, Prepare 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
