{"_id":"9RENytnhIganlyq4","name":"Corporal Danith Nodar","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A fierce member of the 224th Imperial Armoured Division, corporal Danith Nodar distinguished herself as a furious warrior in the trenches of Mimban. Sporting a conduct record pockmarked with military convictions and commendations alike, Nodar was assigned to Mimban as punishment for insubordination. Her previously promising career, set in motion as a graduate of the Carida academy, had been derailed after an incident on Marca. A zealous Imperial, she took her wrath out on any Mimbanese guerrilla she could lay her sights on. This fury has earned her the esteem of her 224th division superiors, esteem Nodar hopes will justify promotion despite her blemished record."}},"items":[{"_id":"GeJzLDidYeWb4Ywc","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ryizoLap8e5kN2TA","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"QCfNSAF8ovJ3fnfV","name":"E-22 blaster carbine","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Cumbersome 2, Linked 1, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"LqvGql3HhsDbKy9s","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"rNmUx3Q7SMErg0LV","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"kVkfbkRi5UUQdXNW","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9UOJAt1WT4Dgvrtz","name":"Drawn In","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Characters ensnared by a Vixus add :setback::setback: to their checks to break free. If they fail or do not attempt the check, at the end of their turn they are pulled one range band closer to the Vixus’ maw. Should they end their turn at Engaged range of the Vixus, they are swallowed alive and are immobilised until released. Should the Vixus suffer a :hard: or worse Critical injury, or be killed, it immediately releases all captives."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9Wcc6TpekqGIqlrI","name":"Death Star Trooper","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Death Star troopers are specially trained Imperial Navy personnel assigned to billets aboard the DS-1 Death Star mobile battle station. Culled from the Imperial Navy’s various branches and given extensive training in the operation and maintenance of their new home’s many systems, these troopers are proud to ensure that the massive battle station runs at peak efficiency. Experts in combat and various technical specialities, Death Star troopers are considered among the most qualified and well-rounded personnel in the Navy. They wear a uniform consisting of a double-breasted military tunic, trousers, and tall black leather boots. An oversized, tear-drop-shaped, open-faced helmet completes the ensemble worn while on duty."}},"items":[{"_id":"mcHG5TQFStzLnmj1","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9XI7CYrH8kIro3mr","name":"Grenzo","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Grenzo is a Rodian bounty hunter who has taken up a long-term contract with Cam. Cam is Grenzo’s meal ticket, and he won’t let anything threaten that. Should things turn ugly, the Rodian will not hesitate to kill anyone he sees as an opponent."}},"items":[{"_id":"XH3adWbtahfXOQFn","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Gtay0FTSaXOOOCuh","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9hDqVOSGFilk0Ekb","name":"Stunning Blow","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"May inflict damage as Strain instead of Wounds; does not ignore Soak."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9hE3ureRm5lFxjgO","name":"Carrion Spat","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Strangely proportioned, gangly, and incredibly ugly, carrion spats are often said to be the most unlikely creature in the galaxy. They seem to be an evolutionary dead-end; they are primitive, flightless birds with reptilian features, a sharp black beak, beady eyers, and long powerful, legs that can kick holes in a ferrocrete wall. They are spiteful, cross-grained, and aggressive beasts that are hard to tame and dangerous to work with, even after they’ve been domesticated. As their name suggests, carrion spats feed on dead and decayed animals, which makes them unpleasant to be around due to the lingering stench of death that surrounds them. However, this diet makes them nearly immune to poisons and toxins, and some have even been reported to eat hazardous chemicals and industrial waste with no negative effects.\n\nDespite these shortcomings, they enjoy a fair amount of popularity as riding animals thanks to their size and endurance. Once tamed and used to both saddle and rider, carrions spats make excellent mounts, especially in rough or mountainous country where their innate sense of balance and wide-splayed feet allow them to move through broken terrain with ease. Eventually, after long periods of work with a rider, a carrion spat becomes bonded; after that, it will protect its rider at all costs, even to its death. In combat, unless otherwise directed, these creatures charge headlong into their enemies at incredible speeds, lashing out with their deadly feet and snapping at anything within range of their beaks. Once engaged, they are hard to extract and if they can’t be brought under control , they will fight until exhausted or killed."}},"items":[{"_id":"nFIRMGCyB2gPZnWN","name":"Beak","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Sunder, Vicious 1"}},{"_id":"17L58p7CUacV7md9","name":"Powerful legs","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"9q2B1SNBQYz9Cna1","name":"“Too Low” Talo","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"“Too Low” Talo is the Sullustan second-in-command of Yiyar Salvage’s Wheel cargo bay. Publicly, he was hired to help expand the Yiyar’s operations at the station and smooth over relations with customers. He secretly disrupts their competitors’ operations, from orchestrating minor diversions to bribing officials to hinder them to sabotaging them outright. After the kidnapping attempt at the Wheel, Talo is sent to lead a revenge attack against IsoTech at Scrapheap Point.\n\nTalo is heavily scarred about the head and hands having suffered injuries in numerous illegal operations and a fair number of fights with Imperials and lowlifes alike. He is loud and overbearing, surprising many larger species with his quick temper and toughness. Rumour has it he’s stared down Wookiees and won arguments with Hutts out of sheer tenacity. Talo’s nickname comes from an unfortunate accident in which he overestimated a speeder truck’s total capacity during a fast getaway. He ploughed a load of illicit goods into a canyon rim instead of into the open cargo bay of the waiting smuggler’s ship parked above it."}},"items":[{"_id":"SsEmHESlPQULPNtr","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"x2fvqeuELQxXq7Cf","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"WEnnOrLScxrZQpx1","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
