{"_id":"AWo5pKx0WpbhT8xK","name":"Krath Warrior Zealot","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Krath Warrior Zealots are a fighting force of elite bodyguards fanatically loyal to the Krath of House Faust. These men and women are composed of those that have been recruited into the cult, but don’t have a strong enough connection to the Force to become full Death Witches. After rigorous indoctrination, their training focuses on traditional Tetan hand-tohand combat techniques supplemented by their limited connections to the Dark Side. At any given time there are about a dozen of these elite warriors in existence and Salandra always has at least two in her personal retinue posing as normal ceremonial bodyguards."}},"items":[{"_id":"PEqY0NirrAohoG5V","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"KXJyM5kMX6Jaoziy","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ez8PYP7P694iegGN","name":"Ceremonial vibro-ax","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 3, Sunder"}},{"_id":"mVLFJ0MPT7YPNB2I","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"A4MFiHdH5n91cnEJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"11esJ8OP4GqahspU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"AX6SarxQZ5PyRvdn","name":"Spectre 5: Sabine Wren","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Sabine Wren is a Mandalorian of House Vizsla, a skilled mechanic and specialist in weapons development. She entered the Imperial Academy on Mandalore and there befriended fellow cadet Ketsu Onyo, but soon learned that the Empire was using her creations to oppress her people. When her family sided with the Empire instead of her, Sabine fled with Ketsu to become bounty hunters for a short time. This ended in a violent financial dispute that severed their friendship for years. Later, she joined Hera Syndulla’s growing resistance cell where she can put her mechanical combat abilities to their fullest use, often with quite explosive results.\n\nSabine’s demolitions talents are surpassed only by her artistic endeavors, and she takes every opportunity to paint colorful graffiti during Spectre operations. Some even say she might have a great future as an artist, should she survive the war against the Empire. Her Mandalorian heritage, though, may lead her to even greater accomplishments."}},"items":[{"_id":"yBk5JSUAM4sf4pyy","name":"Two blaster pistols","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Accurate 1, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"jGyedoCdwqe5LHk5","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"8rvE2QDJlnTy9kg2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"rvjsT11R96W3Z58T","name":"Pistols Blazing","type":"talent","system":{"description":"As an incidental, suffer 1 Strain to avoid increasing the difficulty of a Ranged: Light check to attack with two pistol weapons.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"AZrKgyfmk0dJqbjy","name":"Raider","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Raiders and brigands haunt the roads and wild places of Weik. They hail from every species, united only by their greed and vicious disregard for sentient life."}},"items":[{"_id":"aP364S1b9YAlW6cU","name":"Stabbing sword","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Vicious 1"}},{"_id":"GDyL12PHtGqcPpPi","name":"Hand crossbow","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Limited Ammo 1, Prepare 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"AcSeo9nrvBSZbkVQ","name":"Kaltho the Hutt, Crime Lord","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The great Hutt Kaltho is a curious sight and much smaller than the norm for one of his standing (he only dines on the finest of delicacies). He is still as enormous as an adult Hutt would naturally be, with the occasional grotesque fold of loose skin indicating some past act of gluttony before he began to waste away. When in public or in a gathering with outsiders, Kaltho conceals his shrunken body with a massive black garment of Corellian nanosilk enbroidered with great scenes from the history and mythology of the Hutts."}},"items":[{"_id":"AahWY8qt9Y4CpHM5","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"O4xDtMXLoz8Yt0QZ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
