{"_id":"FCspIbaHj5w4fAKC","name":"CT-4 Medical Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The CT-4 series medical droids are manufactured in Polis Massa by Polis Massa Pria Assemblage, and are almost exclusively used there. They are similar in many respects to the EW-3 midwife droid but are more generalized in their application. A handful of the units are on loan to the Rebel Alliance, though they are rarelv used awav from the Rebel Fleet.\n\nSpecializing in the application of bacta, the CT-4 possesses programming that makes it familiar with thousands of sentient species and their physiological peculiarities. Their personalities are caring and thoughtful, and their relatively small size and non-human shape rarely sets patients at ease in the same way as does the more familiar 2-1 B surgical droid."}},"items":[{"_id":"vIKVKFk1fV3p5JY9","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"lfTtcEdoBgEam4bs","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
