{"_id":"FNUk3j5lpYxxsNHi","name":"Galactic Senator","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"There is no “typical” Galactic Senator. Each is as unique as the world they represent, known among their fellow Senators for their particular strengths, quirks, and approach to politics. Although the popular idea of a Senator is that of a corrupt and venal self-server, many Senators do act with the welfare of their constituents as their first priority. Senators are charismatic individuals, and most are well-educated. The most successful Senators learn to manage the balance between the unique culture of the Galactic Senate and the desires of their constituents.\n\nDue to the vast diversity of worlds within the Republic, Senator come from a wide variety of backgrounds. Some Senators represent monarchies or other autocratic governments, appointed by a ruler or council rather than the population of a world. The myriad views and histories of the Senate’s membership may be both its greatest strength and weakness."}},"items":[{"_id":"DnlfRLm5TsFHnb1r","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ADFbAN42i7guTv4d","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
