{"_id":"FWhM8LVGwQcuRR4m","name":"Saw Gerrera","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"During the Clone Wars, Saw Gerrera fought with Onderon rebels against the Separatists. Jedi representatives trained him in insurgent techniques and strategies and he has applied the same lessons against the Imperial military and to the fight for Jedha against the Empire.\n\nConstant warfare has taken its toll on Gerrera’s body and spirit, but he remains a forceful leader who continues fighting despite overwhelming odds. His extreme tactics have split him away from other resistance groups, but his intelligence gathering efforts, especially concerning Geonosis, may prove invaluable to ending the Empire’s new super-weapon."}},"items":[{"_id":"sSu9Uo8fgaOaHk9Q","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"XlQjZYza2Ks3XZUO","name":"Walking stick","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":""}},{"_id":"iCHLtyj75V6BUyxu","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"HRf8ibHhoCcyGefz","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"KPjAaUD32a9gt3y2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"FWzcbjuJUBO3fNo2","name":"Hologlide J57 Cam Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Cam droids, or hovercams, are small, relatively simple droids equipped with repulsorlifts and recording devices. Used to record news, sports and entertainment events, as well as for security, cam droids are a common sight throughout the galaxy. As such, they are also ideal for scouting and espionage purposes, able to go virtually anywhere without drawing undo attention. While some cam droids are highly intelligent and capable of autonomous action, most are simple devices. Most cam droids can broadcast whatever they record in real-time, up to a distance of several kilometers, allowing the holovids to be rebroadcast or viewed by a remote operator."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"FdeMBThuRmEgvnEz","name":"ISB Security Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Jerserra’s agents earlier stole and reprogrammed these more advanced and dangerous ISB model to patrol the mansion as well. They more than make up for their lower numbers with superior firepower and armour plating."}},"items":[{"_id":"i6iZO0XNNW6rEYnd","name":"Built-in light repeating blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":11,"critical":3,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Auto-Fire, Pierce 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
