{"_id":"HaGrW99irywAIMFR","name":"Coruscant Underworld Police","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Anonymous and imposing in their long leather uniforms and enclosing helmets, the Underworld Police are a mystery to most. However, few who have been on the wrong end of their heavy blasters doubt the danger they pose for lawbreakers."}},"items":[{"_id":"Zkm2A6Q0Pxyo1YHC","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"bHELZYFEBRFSUsBZ","name":"Stun club","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Disorient 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HayCv17d96CmLBC3","name":"Creeping Posenaur","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These small but vicious lizards roam the few solid patches of land on Dagobah. They stand one meter tall and have only two legs. Their long tails allow them to run quickly, and webbed feet help them cross small patches of water or boggy land. They primarily eat rodents and other small prey. Posenaurs are pack hunters. If a large enough group bands together, its members can take down prey many times their size with their powerful jaws and razor-sharp claws. While individual posenaurs avoid larger creatures, a pack can be extremely dangerous."}},"items":[{"_id":"6rNXicE3hes0MKiU","name":"Bite","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Hc5Lazt0Eju5p3rO","name":"Resilient Metabolism","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Add :success: to any Resilience checks."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HcGf3e93YtOGT4Nt","name":"Steela Gerrera","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"oncelbfMqx6WsCi5","name":"Steela’s marksman rifle","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"10","critical":"3","range":"Extreme","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Accurate 1, Pierce 3"}},{"_id":"KVpDDXxOzGhzHQis","name":"Ion grenade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"10","critical":"5","range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Blast 7, Disorient 5, Ion, Limited Ammo 1"}},{"_id":"sS8VUeR1DI1VGAWQ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"GkcKF9hDISqZ7hMX","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"VviwGkvEXEKe21xo","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"u9kF22dJ7enhweyJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Hd3zrWHBS89Dq3uK","name":"Military Starfighter Pilot","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Starfighters are an essential component of any major military installation. The small, fast ships can harry much larger targets and support a vast array of fire-power that can make them a threat even to capital-scale vessels. The tactics of the Rebel Alliance, and particularly their victory at the Battle of Yavin, has demonstrated that starfighters can be a vital component of any attack force. Starfighters may be tasked with defending parent ships against enemy starfighters, scouting and reconnaissance, or even heavy assaults on enemy ships or installations. However, the pilots of these vessels almost always possess quick reflexes, talented piloting skills, and a foolhardy bravado."}},"items":[{"_id":"N6xt7ign3yZ1I75Q","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HgyuXnklVTqsEysV","name":"Underworld Operator","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"x28t0LtGO9payMkE","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Hhk3fRvb8hIDB97T","name":"Murra","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Murra are tall, mammalian herbivores native to the flat grasslands of Corellia’s northern continent. Slow-witted and incredibly strong, murra are raised by the ranchers for their meat, for their thick hides, and as beasts of burden. A murra has four large, curved tusks growing from its lower jaw, and two long horns that sweep backwards from the crown of its blunt head. The murra’s hide is thick yet supple, and covered with a dense mat of stout, coarse hairs like the bristles of a scrubbing brush. Despite their fearsome looks, murra are quite docile and biddable. They have a slow, plodding gait that they can maintain over many, many kilometres of rough terrain, and can haul or pull loads well out of scale with their stature. Though not aggressive, murra can spook easily, and if startled will kick or lash out with their horns. Entire herds of murra, often frightened by loud noises or storms, have been known to stampede en masse, causing incredible amounts of damage as they go."}},"items":[{"_id":"OYrKyPKaEG7Ql2yH","name":"Horns and hooves","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3, Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HjU9CBxpFKIl76Ge","name":"Reflect (Supreme)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When struck by a ranged attack but before apply­ing Soak, suffer 3 Strain to reduce damage by {ranks|plus-2}. When reflecting a hit that generated :despair: or :threat::threat::threat:, may hit one target within Medium range dealing the same damage as the initial attack, after the original attack is resolved. If the character didn’t make a combat check during their previous turn, suffer 1 Strain instead of 3."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HlkJbJfb5MkvtU2k","name":"Defensive Slicing (Improved)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When defending computer systems, upgrade the difficulty of an opponent’s dice pool {ranks|words}."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Hmfo9NrYQzgWWFk7","name":"Clone Trooper (Rival)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"LVNyeEDOwLHLOs2S","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"DTkhamqu9tfqR3Lv","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"xvIquOMe7CJia0Sr","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HnKErmjE42M0frRo","name":"Narglatch","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"It is unclear exactly where the narglatch evolved, but they are used as mounts for the Talz in the brutal cold of Orto Plutonia; additionally, several variants of this species can be found on other worlds throughout the galaxy, including the swamps of Naboo. Not truly domesticated, these felinoid beasts can be trained to be loyal and fearsome mounts, if a bit headstrong. Unlike most other riding beasts, narglatch are apex predators with hunting instincts, moving quietly to stalk their prey."}},"items":[{"_id":"r7JMyKh4y165jKle","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Linked 1, Vicious 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"HoN7YtJXFoXAZxWy","name":"Varactyl","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Domesticated and trained by the Utai of Utapau, varactyls are large, four-legged, long-necked reptavians known for their surprising speed and agility. These beasts have been exported for thousands of years, and as such can be found on many different worlds, including in the wilds of Kashyyyk and Belsavis. Varactyls make excellent fast-moving mounts, and have been known to rival the speeds of airspeeders in short sprints, with powerful claws that allow them to climb over many obstacles that would hinder most other mounts."}},"items":[{"_id":"1PHvfnmcYDVwlkXV","name":"Beak","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":11,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Vicious 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Hr5eiD9W7hcR8Bx4","name":"Sensor Masking","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Upgrade the difficulty of checks to detect or analyse the droid with electronic equipment or sensors once."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
