{"_id":"IgOg5MJpjPWIjQGo","name":"Deranged Expedition Guide","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The guides from the Far Orbit’s hunting lodge are professional outdoorsmen. Dark side corruption has twisted their love of hunting to a simple lust for violence, but they have not lost their skill as they have gained their new cruelty."}},"items":[{"_id":"jJOpo6hY2TDN2KcH","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"5ZG6brV1fzwdludd","name":"Hunting blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"IkQNnLVDS0NdfRN6","name":"Cendiary Priest","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The cendiary priests are as much a staple of Fume as the lava flows themselves. They wander the streets in tattered smithy aprons, sleeping in doorways or working incessantly in local smithies."}},"items":[{"_id":"ktlDo73WLFgWfggC","name":"Iron-hard fists","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Disorient 4, Knockdown"}},{"_id":"QEqj6MnvVeGdrY1K","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Z0KtLSw4OTN8kwCJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ImssNdSldNAT3edy","name":"Massiff","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Massiffs are armoured predators native to Geonosis. Commonly used as guard animals in the Outer Rim, they are up to a meter tall at the shoulder. Massiffs are vicious predators with keen senses and animal cunning, and they are especially dangerous when starving—as these specimens are. Due to their hunger, these massiffs continue to maul downed opponents until distracted in some fashion."}},"items":[{"_id":"1WJklbsarP4x6b7i","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"OAzGf9T44dunbF6J","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ImwCk6CdJKHxj8l0","name":"General Elora Silssusio","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Polis Massa’s current Rebel commander is General Elora Silssusio. She oversees all Rebel operations and is the Alliance’s chief liaison, coordinator, and negotiator with the Polis Massans. She once ran a private security and investigation service, called Ulterior Vision, which specialized in clandestine work for questionably loyal Imperial Senators. The ISB even tually exposed her activities, but a friendly Senator orchestrated her escape to join a fledgling resistance group in the Outer Rim. When the group joined the Rebel Alliance, she was quickly promoted to lead secret missions throughout the galaxy. She sustained serious injuries in a skirmish while escaping a Star destroyer and was sent to Polis Massa for treatment. While recovering, she used her experience negotiating with Senators to convince the Polis Massans to increase their support for the Alliance.\n\nThe Alliance was impressed, promoted her to general, and placed her in command at Polis Massa. There, she protects the Rebels’ relationship with their hosts, reigning in or expelling anyone who would endanger them. She person ally selects and briefs special operations teams. She has had a seething hatred for the Empire since the dissolution of the Senate, because some of her former clients were arrested and probably killed shortly thereafter. The General rarely wears a formal uniform, so as to avoid undue attention should outsiders see her within the research base."}},"items":[{"_id":"q7M2FDWdq5iRPPe7","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"6SbAx1cHRUMO0vgW","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"9OtDhQeajqHcr9s8","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"bAcKxIYsmWj9c15e","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"FtEsBEZOxCPE5RIf","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
