{"_id":"KNg7f5xsZFnlwIBg","name":"Analysis Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Almost always found working in groups, analysis droids have served governments, corporations, wealthy private individuals, and even the defunct Jedi Knights. Most manufacturers make analysis droids, but the enduring popularity of Cybot Galactica’s SP-4 and JN-66 models make them the category leaders. All analysis droids come equipped with a sophisticated sensory suite and a set of onboard analysis protocols that make them invaluable in aiding research, analysing data, and performing experiments."}},"items":[{"_id":"RYeg3EDtLYpOLkPv","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KRz0kN7EV3CeDg80","name":"Chandrilan Governor","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The governors of Chandrila are among the best public speakers and debaters in the galaxy. Their impassioned arguments and well-researched points make them difficult to debate. While the three most powerful are Governors Centi of Hanna City, Dehsea of Emita, and Millae of Nayli, more than one thousand other governors lead smaller communities, which they represent at Chandrilan House during house sessions.\n\nRespected governors are accessible to their constituents; they are often found in debate forums open to public participation on set days of the week. An elusive governor is considered weak, hiding from public debate of unpopular policies. Governors are typically accompanied by aides."}},"items":[{"_id":"kCBRLLGZw6VVTpLe","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"U9fIsCZv7f4pncou","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"KaGlUaacCYNRFNhx","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
