{"_id":"KkjUHMN3slIzyPHH","name":"TIE Ace","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"While it is true that many joke about the delicate nature of TIE fighters, most have a healthy respect for the swarms of the fighters as they descend in a strafing or bombing run. This reputation is due in large part to the upper echelon of TIE pilots, the aces. These individuals, typically squad leaders and seasoned combat veterans, are a match for even the most arrogant Alliance starhghter pilot."}},"items":[{"_id":"oogAOexv2gBznI8C","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KlrqKDmk3CUCvwao","name":"Bail Organa","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Bail Organa is viceroy of the House of Organa and married to Queen Breha Organa. Serving as Alderaan’s Republic and later Imperial Senator, he was one of the most influential politicians in the latter fays of the Clone Wars. Bail is a member of the Loyaist Committee, a position that lets him see some of Palpatine’s most heinous acts and devkous plots. Using Alderaan’s peaceful reputation to obfuscate his efforts to build resistance to the Empire, Bail skillgully walks a public line of apparently loyal opposition. Possibly his most important duty is educating and guiding the political career of his adopted daughter, Princess Leia. The true identity of Leia’s birth mother — Padmé Amidala — is a closely guarded secret."}},"items":[{"_id":"nETNkX7NNpekM2pu","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"W7HfR2mHuYZ9yE4s","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"GXtETU1QySosCAp2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6ZoUfEAt4tqMns3d","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"V7g0OrYThAEvEtd1","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"sEde8Kg7rpWrItEY","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Km5GcHkllM4SYfst","name":"Expert Tracker","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Remove {ranks|setback} from checks to find tracks or track targets; decrease time to track a target by 50%."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KmFFvohF42f4kHOC","name":"“Lookout”, Exploration Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"This small droid is capable of piloting and the miners used him to scout mines or fly shuttles. This droid is not convinced of the need for revolution, and is more or less satisfied with his role as a servant to sentient organisms. EV-8D3 fitted him with a restraining bolt in order to override his reluctance to rebel. Now Lookout has taken the station’s only airspeeder, a Storm IV cloud car, and has headed off to disable the storm barrier generators under EV-8D3’s orders."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KnUu1x9BX5adA9xF","name":"Getting Results","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When accompanied by armed guards, Gunray gains Coercion 2 (:proficiency::proficiency::ability:) for as long as they are within Short range."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KqYDcgEbN3MyDtFi","name":"Bandin Dobah","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Bandin Dobah is a stereotypical pirate captain: reckless, crude, and aggressive. His belligerence soon earned him the respect of several of his fellows on the Aqualish home world of Ando and he proved a natural gang leader. Dobah’s impressive force of will compensated for his natural lack of charm. He soon made a number of enemies for himself on Ando, and so he embarked on a career as a spacefarer, captaining a roguish crew willing to undertake all manner of mercenary activity or acts of piracy in order to keep the credits rolling in.\n\nAge has mellowed Dobah to some degree, though by any civilized measure he’s still a violent brute. He no longer has the energy to ply the hyperspace routes of the galaxy in search of easy pickings, but he has been able to turn his resources into effectively managing his network of smuggling teams around the Kessel Run. He tends to conduct his business through a series of intermediaries such as Daro Blunt.\n\nDobah still rules through intimidation rather than true leadership qualities, and his crew obeys him more out of fear than loyalty. His bullying and boorishness offend all but the most hardened of space pirates, but while the profits from the black market glitterstim trade continue to flow, they remain loyal nevertheless."}},"items":[{"_id":"SPNUKsWYb4dcip0D","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"GOHp9OQ3un4u04oG","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"xhmkUtnyizALH68D","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"SYe6I2RAcZq3XVjK","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Ksfj1Hk5rQNjKRwx","name":"Cairnmog","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The mount-sized cairnmogs are hooved and horned lizards that feed on fungus, moss, and balmgrass. Generally peaceful and found in groups of two, cairnmogs are occasionally hunted for their skin and meat. If cairnmogs or their eggs are threatened, they are quick to resort to dominance displays or even violence."}},"items":[{"_id":"cV5UxA33i275cV1b","name":"Sharp horns","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"KwG7d80U2ipvomXo","name":"Quick Movement","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Before making a non-Force power check, may suffer 2 Strain to add {Force Rating} to the check; spend :forcepip::forcepip: to perform one free Move maneuver after the check is finished."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
