{"_id":"NBBfaKNj7IMS0wh3","name":"Sentry Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Sentry Droid is a small drone spacecraft tasked with orbiting the asteroid and monitoring the surrounding area for incoming vessels or other hazards. It is programmed to alert Bandin Dobah if it identifies a likely hazard, then intercept it.\n\nThe Sentry Droid is a small spacecraft managed by a droid brain with the following characteristics and skills. The droid brain is a part of the spacecraft, so does not have soak or wound thresholds, or any equipment or abilities. If it ever needs to suffer strain, the ship suffers system strain instead. It ignores any wounds."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"NCDCkt9iJFETudw9","name":"Obi-Wan (Ben) Kenobi","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"On Tatooine, Obi-Wan Kenobi is a lifetime away from his days as a Jedi Master. If he is known at all there, it is as the eccentric old hermit Ben. Of course, this is exactly how Kenobi wants it. He needs to be left alone to watch over Luke Skywalker and to spend time meditating and studying the Force.\n\nHis duty to train the boy as a Jedi has been blocked by Luke’s uncle, but he still protects young Skywalker from many threats.  Kenobi has also needed to defend himself as well from attack, especially from an outcast terror whom he thought defeated many years ago on Naboo. Other figures from his past may also rise again, but Kenobi has had many years to prepare and is ready to whatever it takes to see the Empire ended."}},"items":[{"_id":"Y5Ex01Y2MyvSDFbG","name":"Obi-Wan’s Lightsaber","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":1,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Lightsaber (Intellect)","qualities":"Breach 1, Sunder"}},{"_id":"zfqhHo1zV5iSe9Lw","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"dewEg0EY8ULL9xxC","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"obnjO2my0ImYNs5s","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"XIJ5ypMT9gnPFyd2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Gity8zYSb9inJ7Fo","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"5ZBLOfSgRkuhx580","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ytp84NeTY3S5lEJk","name":"Jedi Defender","type":"talent","system":{"description":"Once per encounter, after igniting his lightsaber, may spend 1 Destiny Point to make enemies within Short range unable to target any other foes except him until the end of his following turn.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"NCENIjqPyZ6aQ0fu","name":"Lt. Commander Jilan Noor","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Jilan Noor is a human male in his early thirties with olive skin, dark eyes, and short-cut black hair. He is a career Navy officer, having risen quickly through the ranks after graduating from the Imperial Academy at the top of his class. He is ruthless and punishes failure harshly among his subordinates. Unsurprisingly, he is hardest on himself, and this is likely his biggest weakness."}},"items":[{"_id":"HjczaYZhLBf5howq","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"c56oVsBDs4YcVR7I","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"FrVIDdWiru4S0j3F","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
