{"_id":"NW875e2ZzqUOXxFK","name":"Sabacc Player","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Possessing enough skill to beat the odds in the long run is rare among gamblers, but especially true for a game as random as sabacc. Whether through dice as in Corellian Spike, or by the shifting cards themselves in the Core Worlds, the element of chance deters many from high stakes sabacc play. Those who do brave the table for game after game bring steely nerves, a keen eye for tells, and a strategic intuition for when to hold or fold. Almost every casino hosts professional players, the same holding true for gambling holes and card sharks, and the question must be asked: game after game, how can they get ahead? There answer is a very particular set of skills combined with the confidence to take prudent risks."}},"items":[{"_id":"eqlrubBCrGTd3chX","name":"Second Chances 1","type":"talent","system":{"description":"Once per encounter, chose one die and reroll it.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"NWZRPfR3t25o4d98","name":"Doran’enok","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Nearly three metres in height, doran’enoks are fearsome reptilian creatures covered in thick scales. They sport numerous spines along their backs and have keen senses of smell (through their forked tongues) but are not much smarter than banthas."}},"items":[{"_id":"3mlYSDKOFLSxudY2","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Knockdown, Pierce 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
