{"_id":"Pmk2AuiGF398QpwG","name":"Intelligence Agent","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Imperial Intelligence is a separate entity from the military, but they often work hand-in-hand to accomplish their mutual objectives. The autonomy of Imperial Intelligence often allows them to co-opt military assets to accomplish their missions, occasionally to the chagrin of the officers who command the ships or companies utilized in such a manner. Regardless, the threat posed by intelligence agents is particularly significant, because they do not adhere to standard military protocol and are easily able to think outside the rigid tactical instruction of the Army and Navy. Seasoned agents understand how the Alliance thinks, and that makes them exceptionally dangerous."}},"items":[{"_id":"0tBCaxdJAFMup9Ml","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Pn01BTcIPDjPlYnQ","name":"Encouraging Words","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When an ally at Engaged range fails a check, may suffer 1 Strain to assist the next check that ally makes in this encounter as an out of turn incidental."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"PnnRTchuzA3tWLU9","name":"Resistance Trooper 6","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"bUUsuEms1B1HMZdE","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"CPo6wsQZlIhyTq1A","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"wJaK9od5UdbltQtp","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Porr85ltbgoabya7","name":"FD-Series Extinguisher Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A highly specialized maintenance droid, fire suppression droids perform the singular function of putting out fires. These droids are particularly useful aboard starships, where fires can quickly burn up the oxygen and cause irreparable damage to a vessel. Generally mounted on tracked chassis or repulsorlifts and fitted with large tanks of chemical fire retardants, fire suppression droids can quickly respond to out-of-control fires raging through a ship and are able to safely work under conditions that would be hazardous or even lethal to organic beings.\n\nFire suppression droids can be used aboard any vehicle or starship with a silhouette of 4 or larger. Plowever, the larger the vessel, the more droids are needed to adequately protect the vessel from fires. A vessel with a silhouette of 4 may require only one fire suppression droid, while a bulk transport or corvette would need several; a starship the size of an Imperial Star Destroyer would need hundreds of droids to adequately protect its massive bulkheads and kilometres of corridors and access shafts. These droids are able to put out small fires independently."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Pr2QmYs4jk8WFjBK","name":"Trained Keelkana","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"During the reign of the Mon Calamari monarchy, the order of Mon Calamari knights defended the kingdom from a variety of undersea threats while mounted atop armoured keelkana eels. While undersea war mounts lost favour after the Clone Wars, keelkana racing has recently grown in popularity in Mon Calamari Space. The massive, snakelike fish have a vicious temperament and teeth sharp enough to pierce armour-plating. Wild keelkana can be found in deep sea trenches across Mon Cala."}},"items":[{"_id":"ZoxD4jyDWkea3F8U","name":"Jaws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3, Vicious 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"PwJnkEY6R9MyB2tz","name":"Wheel Security","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"4K7Qe1r4UlV4eQsC","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"iBfZUVtiJxtR7SeW","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Px8iQEdXnNcXMB6y","name":"Imperial Test Pilot","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The pilots of the 481 st Experimental Starfighter Test ing Squadron are the best of the best, hand picked by Gareth Agamar for their piloting skills, courage, and technical acumen. Charged with testing out new and potentially dangerous fightercraft, these individuals are looked on by rank-and-file Navy pilots with equal parts admiration and pity: admiration due to their obvious skill and the prestigious nature of their roles as test pilots, but pity due to the fact that flying an untested spaceframe with new and perilous engines and weapon systems is extremely dangerous. Turnover in the 481st is particularly high for what is ostensibly a non-combat unit, and new pilots are constantly being brought into the squadron as old pilots are injured or killed."}},"items":[{"_id":"igrL1yt7eT1EfAdn","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Sdqs27SLf69vNUZU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6zZv58l3L9pGnwe1","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"YUD8VzHlf90DF0Yo","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
