{"_id":"Qzd5ByNIVAWW47gR","name":"LM-432 Crab Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These powerful droid tanks are among the heaviest unit deployed in the Separatist ground forces. Their six powerful limbs can batter aside any opposition that makes it into dose quarters, while the dual blaster cannons slung under the droid’s main chassis destroy more distant foes, sometimes even before the enemies’ weapons are in range to return fire. Although not as capable in urban environments or similarly constrained quarters as battle droids or the smaller dwarf spider walkers, a detachment of crab droids can dominate a large-scale engagement in open terrain, as their thick plating negates the need for cover."}},"items":[{"_id":"0eSJwB6wUNInpRAm","name":"Integrated dual heavy repeating blasters","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":15,"critical":2,"range":"Long","skill":"Gunnery","qualities":"Auto-Fire, Linked 1, Pierce 2, Vicious 1"}},{"_id":"M8CDvvFIZkhNJoJX","name":"Clawed limb","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 1, Knockdown"}},{"_id":"RO6Ec6AZfE9IJoBp","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"R1ZkEvp15NvxXcxv","name":"Shape Shift","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As an action, suffer 3 strain and make an :average: Resilience check to change appearance to a previously observed Silhouette 1 character. Observers must make an opposed Perception vs. Deception check to detect something is amiss."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"R23148hXZ9NRtx1F","name":"Halina Patel","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"One of the ISB’s most gifted intelligence analysts, Halina Patel is a highly intelligent polymath. There are few in the ISB or Alliance Intelligence who can match her prowess with a slicing rig, and few computer security systems can withstand her attentions. A striking, dark-eyed woman in her middle years, she is easily recognizable due to the cybernetic computer interface construct that wraps around her shaved head. In the field, she typically conceals her implant with wigs or scarves, and she is so accomplished at doing so that it takes a very keen eye to spot the implant."}},"items":[{"_id":"wqIHklWvk1j0stXe","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Y90Lfjq3hzVuCjW4","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ZP1EnWzBX2EVJUmy","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"mAJnF4WecqBXW1Yk","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"x9GIIL4eF0NBqDU8","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"QSbc7OZAAXrXRECS","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"RnmwHixOxpPikwHU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
