{"_id":"R8c8qAKgGljfVCWn","name":"Tusken Raider (Never Tell Me the Odds)","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The most commonly encountered Tusken Raider is the simple minion. Hardly a threat by themselves, they can put up stiff opposition in larger numbers... and a Tusken Raider is almost never known to travel alone.\n\nSimple minions are generally only armed with a Gaffi Stick, the traditional weapon of the Sand People. Although they don’t like much, in trained hands a Gaffi Stick can be used effectively to defend, and are particularly well suited to delivering dazing blows to opponents.\n\nA Tusken Raiders is only ever seen swaddled from head to feet in their traditional padded, desert wrappings and filter masks. These robes not only serve as armour, but help them endure the heat and sandstorms of the Tatooine badlands."}},"items":[{"_id":"K3BLffDwpPJHE5e4","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"RjDQ98Vrx0n3VLRU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RAfqTvMYgReeOX6m","name":"Doellinist High Priest","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Doellinist priesthood on Kinyen is the only career path Gran can choose without government interfer ence. Any Gran interested in joining the priesthood, or who wish to escape the job sector chosen for them by Kinyen’s government, can apply. The priesthood also offers part-time opportunities that allow Gran to remain in their designated profession as well. An estimated one in ten Gran have achieved some measure of standing within the priesthood and are trained to provide counsel, comfort, and company to those Gran in need."}},"items":[{"_id":"tELK8W0L0aD1KzhM","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"PIn7uf1LuiG6x9YA","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"sOmZlaPPY5CkIuM9","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"U456V9pc7vqZokJ1","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RAjDnCzCx4r0XitH","name":"Landspeeder","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RAmALiGhmgzZEUAQ","name":"Haril Zense, Rebel Spy","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Haril is a skilled Rebel spy in his mid-forties. A man of deep laughter and a booming voice, he has light brown hair, a close-cropped beard, and is physically fit. He is not particularly tall, which helps him blend in.\n\nA former pilot, Haril Zense gave up his ship years ago when his reflexes began to falter. Zense knew that, while he wasn’t as skilled in a cockpit any longer, he could continue to serve the Alliance in other ways. After conducting a number of special operations for different Rebel cells, Zense found his way to Ord Radama in one of the most trying missions of his life. Zense bristles at the lack of action being taken against the imperials and wishes to strike a blow for the Rebellion on Ord Radama. Nobody knows how much longer he can bear to sit and watch without carrying out an attack against the Empire."}},"items":[{"_id":"76TEDNjdxIg1bD93","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"FFVOaI0xdb6Jf32w","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RBJxEILiuLH3Pked","name":"Stormtrooper: Scout Trooper","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Reconnaissance is one of the most important aspects of any military organization, and the Imperial Stormtrooper Corps is no different. More lightly armoured to facilitate rapid movement and trained with rapid-response repulsorlift vehicles, scout troopers are at the forefront of any insertion of the stormtrooper legions into a new theater of operations."}},"items":[{"_id":"iIvWm8laQdgrPyvR","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"fQ0dEE53UvMYJurP","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"0Xd4XmZjlxWqagQR","name":"Blaster sniper rifle with scope","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":3,"range":"Extreme","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Accurate 1, Cumbersome 3, Pierce 2, Slow-Firing 1, Sniper Shot"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RBMkUFMCLaLLtV6c","name":"Accurate","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"For each rank of this trait, the attacker adds :boost: to their attack dice pools while using this weapon."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"RCPl58d3UNO2s5Z6","name":"Aimee “Flutterplume” Kraeff, Pit Fighter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Aimee Kraeff has worked much of her life to rise above her family’s poverty. Born to Corellian parents in one of Ord Mantell’s farming villages, she ran away from home in her teens and was nearly killed by a Mantellian Savrip. A band of Scraplands nomads found her near death and nursed her back to health before taking her to Worlport. Alone and without prospects, Aimee soon found herself participating in underground blood sports under the alias of Flutterplume. Since then, she’s made quite a name for herself. Aimee intends to return to her family and lift them out of poverty once she’s made her fortune as a fighter in Worlport. She sends money to her parents whenever she can, but she’s heard nothing from them for several weeks and is growing increasingly worried. Flutterplume is a muscular young woman in her early twenties with spiked hair and grey eyes. Her back is marred by a series of deep scars, souvenirs from the Savrip attack she survived in her youth. When fighting, she does so anonymously, wearing a thin, form-fitting mask adorned with shining flutterplume feathers."}},"items":[{"_id":"0xsQVS6SOhuY1HlX","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"6TL4BRaGTGN1E7fc","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"yRHnw4tuRkNuA5P3","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
