ercion check, adding :force: no greater than Force rating. Disorient one target within Medium range per :success:. Spend :advantage::advantage: to extend duration and :triumph: to stagger one target. Spend :darkside: to immobilise one target.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"pVx6iuu11gIcCZUR","name":"Shien Technique","type":"talent","system":{"description":"When making a Lightsaber check, may use Cunning instead of Brawn.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
