{"_id":"Sez7NJdny0OM2pbg","name":"Spectre 1: Kanan Jarrus","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Kana Jarrus is a former Jedi Padawan whose master was killed in Order 66. Barely escaping, he quickly abandoned his birth name of Caleb Dume and spent years in the shadows avoiding Imperial notice as a minor smuggler and a pilot-for-hire. This life ended when Hera Syndulla encountered him in the Gorse system, where they worked together to thwart an Imperial noble from destroying a world to reap enormous profits. As part of theur battles, he revealed himself as a Force user and was later convinced to join her in fighting back against the Empire.\n\nKanan’s training from the Clone Wars has been invaluable in planning and executing missions the Spectres undertake, but perhaps his most important role is as mentor and instructor to Ezra Bridger. Finding another Force-sensitive has allowed Jarrus to put his master’s training to use again, though he often worries he is not up to the task and is afraid his impatient charge may be slowly falling to the darkness.These feelings became intensified when he was blinded in a ferocious combat with Maul on Malachor. Kanan now uses the Force to compensate for his lack of sight, and has also achieved a greater understanding of the Force through his interactions with the mysterious being known as Bendu."}},"items":[{"_id":"y48h4vMeBN7hXFe2","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"lDDbK4vSzWQanmKN","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Lightsaber","qualities":"Breach 1, Sunder, Modular"}},{"_id":"uSyGgDwfxCX38Lg3","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"m016k1tXn8WPyc3Z","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"k4aBnly19JowTCMJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"P4Mro1eIX4WwgnG2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6LQh0Zi8dzkDKq53","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
