{"_id":"Ub0ocKCKfkKLzvyj","name":"Quarrie","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Am old shipwright from Mon Calamari, Quarrie saw what the Republic was turning into at the end of the Clone Wars and fled to Shantipole. He set up a secret workshop here, and offered his services to a small number of trusted outlaws, scoundrels, and rebel fighters with the help of his fussy astromech, BG-81. Only the best pilots go to him, because only the best pilots can land safely. Quarrie’s workshop is nevertheless something of an open secret among smugglers.\n\nQuarrie has plied his trade here for over a decade, all the while working on a secret project: the Blade Wing starfighter. Recently, Hera Syndulla came looking for help. She convinced him to allow her to test the ship, which performed better than expectations. Impressed with Syndulla, Quarrie joined the resistance. He has taken his design to the Roche Asteroid Field, where he works to refine his design for operational use."}},"items":[{"_id":"asub19VW82R8lGkH","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"LKumNfWd45fH8haG","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
