{"_id":"W010A5on2t5uHftN","name":"Trandoshan Heavy","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These elite Trandoshan warriors were infamous as some of the most dangerous heavy assault mercenaries in the galaxy. Protected by thick plates of durasteel armour and armed with the devastating LS-150 heavy repeater, Trandoshan Heavies were found in mercenary companies and slaving parties throughout the Outer Rim. In battle, these mercenaries throw caution to the wind by wading into the heaviest enemy positions, heavy repeaters constantly shooting an unrelenting torrent of charged particles. Most boast hearty kill counts, commanding the respect of their fellow Trandoshans. This respect feeds both the Trandoshan Heavy’s stereotypical arrogance, as well as healthy credit accounts from the high pay and share of loot they demand."}},"items":[{"_id":"EipEdAMjMZ8ftVMc","name":"LS-150 heavy ACP repeater","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":13,"critical":3,"range":"Long","skill":"Gunnery","qualities":"Autofire, Cumbersome 4, Pierce 2"}},{"_id":"by9uk4TUkQgV4rm0","name":"LS-150 bayonet","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Inaccurate 2, Pierce 2, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"s9F8fKVVotefJc8N","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"toa1XBOs7ilYzElw","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"CwbekOsDnS7YOCST","name":"Rain of Death","type":"talent","system":{"description":"Perform the Rain of Death maneuver to ignore the increased difficulty due to the Auto-Fire quality of attacks made this turn.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
