{"_id":"W16j7XSnqfMlW9VD","name":"Spintiri Glowbat","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"sFEfMGkwVjXmjJg6","name":"Blinding spray","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":5,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Disorient 3, Stun Damage, Slow-Firing 3"}},{"_id":"fzQ5IXMzwHJygUVC","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"W4b5UXbVKc2N2CRc","name":"Green Nikto","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Add 1 rank in Coordination and a Green Nikto may add :boost: to checks to climb. Additionally, add claws as an unarmed attack."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"W7aB8Z0OQrmK9FJ1","name":"Thamoss","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Thamoss is a Trandoshan merchant with a penchant for dealing in weapons and military-grade components. He’s cunning and cruel, and he prides himself on getting the best of any deal. He hires covert muscle to oversee his deals, and this incident is no exception. Thamoss has decided that Corte’s going to pay for her insults, and he intends to use his disruptor pistol to take his revenge.\n\nShould the PCs end up helping Thamoss, he is unlikely to offer them direct monetary compensation. He might, however, have some jobs for them in the future as enforcers. If the PCs make an enemy of Thamoss and he survives the encounter, though, they can expect to see the vindictive Trandoshan again in their future dealings in Hutt Space. The GM could represent this as a small Obligation generated by Thamoss’ ongoing animosity, or simply handle it narratively by having him appear again seeking recompense."}},"items":[{"_id":"B4nvO8r6n0o4sDr2","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"4ky0CNhJFSXDBeCS","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"BVkz9WUXjB2kNXYR","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ClQAGcTBPkZKRxHv","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WAs9RwBGwFGRrzDD","name":"SoroSuub Corporate Security","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Well-paid and well-trained, these private security officers are tasked with keeping the various SoroSuub facilities throughout SoroSuub Central safe for their corporate masters. While a majority are native Sullustans, a handful of other species can be found among their ranks. Equipped with the latest and best that SoroSuub can supply, and using military-style tactics in their policing, these officers are not to be trifled with."}},"items":[{"_id":"dEj3yAxcjt41z3Uj","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"vcEwYZgW9WjbbaAy","name":"Stun baton","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":6,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Disorient 2, Stun Damage"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WBKIF6EpOq9EKH1L","name":"T’landa Til Charlatan","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Originally hailing from Varl, t’landa Til are massive sentient quadrupeds distantly related to the Hutts. Til possess thick, trunk like legs, a thin whip of a tail, and two slender arms. The t ’landa Til are not as wealthy or powerful as the Hutts, and many of them serve the Hutts in various capacities."}},"items":[{"_id":"WhNE0ZK27tK1A4Pa","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WBgGDcJNV23qmrGw","name":"Su­premely Terrifying","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Upon first seeing a sando aqua monster, an individual must make a :daunting-1: fear check to reflect the sheer dread the beast invokes."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WCFqiEMiSkqCzVsy","name":"Reom","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Reom is a blue-skinned Twi’lek male who uses his supremely average, nondescript appearance to blend in perfectly with any starport crowd. He camouflages himself with dark grey cloaks and jumpsuits which are common in most of the stations and cultures he visits.\n\nReom is president of IsoTech. He is a talented smuggler, crafty enterpreneur, and superb negotiator. He has contacts throughout the galaxy, including powerful figures in the underworld. Reom handles IsoTech’s Outer Rim operations, particularly new acquisitions and allies."}},"items":[{"_id":"EPtRnzWiO68SRsxE","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"axYcJLKAABP0WXed","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"3bIHjcBcW4eJfeBX","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"pvyLCa6j5QftIkGn","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"51ssR4Pf8gtXNTcI","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"iDVjq5KvhB3PpaWH","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WCmkOaER43jpFEth","name":"Wealthy Noble","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The nature of the Core Worlds has created an environment that promotes a caste system, something long ago abandoned by all but the most primitive worlds, but which has come full circle to return to the most “civilized” of worlds in the galaxy. Nobles have little to do other than maintain their vast wealth, the majority of which is gained through inheritance and investment, and most leave the Core only rarely. Younger nobles sometimes have a taste for excitement and adventure, however, and occasionally venture out to see the galaxy and experience how the lesser beings live. Most of these young nobles are capricious and largely without compassion, but a handful occasionally find the plight of the galaxy deplorable enough to find a way to discreetly offer their assistance to the Alliance. Such patrons are rare, but extremely valuable to the Rebels, who court them as much as they can without compromising their political and military agendas."}},"items":[{"_id":"V2PUamItZBbeHfNZ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"EweOXNIhvuTMpswS","name":"Antique vibrosword","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Defensive 1, Pierce 2, Vicious 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WFbIX9IIGZiiA2H5","name":"Riff Tamson","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"P8TR99cxTjDkIoZB","name":"Karkarodon bite","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"7","critical":"3","range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"YRhiPGv5Ln1dwp1Z","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Z384bz4rbNBslVNa","name":"Karkarodon grenade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"13","critical":"3","range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Blast 4, Limited Ammo 1, Pierce 3, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"WxeU397iz92j6AfL","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"5jusdj0bf3hwviNP","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"dA39iwK4v9yd3V4S","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"jLNCtK7QqDiiD9MC","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WGeQxGxaBsaZCEfu","name":"Agent Kallus","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A human born on Coruscant, Kallus joined the ISB shortly after his graduation from the Royal Imperial Academy. Initially, he worked on the ISB’s Internal Affairs and Investigations branches. After fighting insurgents on Onderon and participating in the cleansing of Lasan (where he acquired a rare bo-rifle), Kallus was transferred to Lothal under the command of Wullf Yularen to eliminate the resistance activity in that system.\n\nDuring his time on Lothal, Agent Kallus (code name ISB-021) met with repeated failure in his attempts to defeat the crew of the *Ghost*. These failures led to an escalation in his tactics, and Kallus worked with increasingly prominent Imperial agents to defeat the growing insurrections. Despite the setbacks he has faced, he displays a strong sense of personal honour. There are suspicions that the acts of the Empire have become dishonourable in his eyes, and that he could be turning traitor. However, few, if any, could ever believe that such a staunch and loyal example of Imperial efficiency could ever become disloyal."}},"items":[{"_id":"gR0AfhyQAsnF2VFP","name":"Bo-rifle (ranged profile)","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Cumbersome 3, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"12KGrMB3zLguf3vA","name":"Bo-rifle (melee profile)","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Cumbersome 3, Defensive 1, Disorient 2, Knockdown, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"njOObAMo4Fvdh2I5","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"leBQ6GaP6dj7dQKJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WLnKalpYfCmvAp9d","name":"Resistance Trooper","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Outnumbered, outgunned, and on the run, the Resistance against the First Order lacks the personnel for normal military specialization. Where the New Republic, First Order, and even Rebel Alliance maintained dedicated infantry units for ground combat, the Resistance cannot afford such specialization. When the need arises, the Resistance calls upon its pilots, technicians, spies, and others to pick up a blaster rifle and pitch in to a ground fight.\n\nAlthough paling in comparison to true infantry, limited cross training provided by the Resistance’s tiny cadre of commandos provides all Alliance personnel the basic skills needed. Less effective than the First Order’s stormtroopers in a straight up fight, a fringe benefit from this ad-hoc approach means each Resistance squad is likely to contain experts in other fields. Since the Resistance employs asymmetrical tactics aimed at delaying and exposing the First Order, it is actually these oddball skills that can mean the difference between victory and defeat."}},"items":[{"_id":"YdXgQaG9bz01VpBS","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"E2Rre6Cmkwo2Q0DU","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"5UvKYrlSf4Qfu7Vf","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WO9NeK4PVAeHIThH","name":"New Mandalorian Police","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"MGb0PMfV66HwRxqw","name":"WESTAR-35 blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"6","critical":"2","range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Accurate 1, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"2TsctD0YlkpnGtBC","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Tfgk8OEg3DIzh7XP","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"WScuROliiRiHIcE2","name":"Jubba Bird","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Jubba birds are found in marketplaces, palaces, and the homes of wealthy merchants and upwardly mobile criminals throughout the galaxy, although they are native to the swamps of Dagobah. Brightly colored avians with reptilian features, jubba birds are prized for their red, yellow, and purple plumage as much as for their beautiful, haunting song. The jubba bird’s whis tling call is actually an instinctual ability to tap into the Living Force, and it produces a peaceful sensation in those who hear it. Jubba birds have small bodies but large wings, and they fare poorly in cages. Luckily, if an owner feeds his bird regularly, it is more than content to remain on a roost or perch and refrain from terror izing a household or attempting to hunt other pets. On Dagobah, jubba birds hunt small prey such as rodents or other birds, but in captivity, a well-fed jubba bird will fight only to defend itself. Most importantly, if the jubba bird is not content, it refuses to sing.\n\nFew owners realize that jubba birds are deceptively intelligent. While not as smart as most sapient species, they possess a level of cunning and a capacity for comprehension that dwarfs most animal species. Some researchers suspect that jubba birds deliberate ly pretend to be less intelligent when interacting with other species. These suspicions are only reinforced by rumors that, when paired with owners they trust and care for, jubba birds can act with more deliberation and foresight."}},"items":[{"_id":"K3YTxYyh5vbnjOLC","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":2,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}},{"_id":"iLov2oIZf1SWNrST","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
