{"_id":"WXRJ9o0DvB4lJmDE","name":"Mon Mothma","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As the one-time Republic and later Imperial Senator from Chandrila, Mon Mothma promoted negotiation and peaceful resolutions to some of the galaxy’s worst events. Along with Bail Organa and Padmé Amidala, she opposed Chancellor Palpatine’s efforts to consolidate power during the Clone Wars, and pushed for negotiations with the Separatists. After the Emperor seized control, she continued the struggle publicly while she could. Behind the scenes, however, she realised that he would never be dissuaded and would have to be removed by force. Eventually, her opposition grew into into a very public denunciation of the Emperor. This became more than the Empire could tolerate, especially coupled with her suspected ties to resistance fighters. She now leads the nascent Rebel Alliance as its Commander in Chief, working tirelessly to band together disparate groups and fighting forces into enough of a cohesive force to remove the Emperor and defeat the Empire."}},"items":[{"_id":"gWrYqi2Upq9k1twG","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"9NpVphk1SVdCLYlC","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"qpiSu8KREN6UsMgV","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
