{"_id":"WhZW1PJVQl9E0yVR","name":"Hyperlane Scout","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As vast as the Empire is, it is dwarfed by the galaxy as a whole. Though many hyperlanes great and small have been established, there are countless routes between the stars waiting to be discovered. It is in the unknown spaces at the edges of the charts and beyond that hyperlane scouts ply their trade. These brave souls are always looking for the next unexplored planet or unmapped star route, and many of them are willing to go to an length to be the first to stake their claim to the rights-of-discovery of new ways or worlds."}},"items":[{"_id":"xLz05Qud6oBB6wac","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"7iqOftLHbRcLPcUl","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
