{"_id":"XiNAUjWQgyxnqN2e","name":"Professor Huyang","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"lt3SiovmNDiUqcxs","name":"Welding torch","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"6","critical":"4","range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Burn 3"}},{"_id":"bMl8hdsn9SjJyq56","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"b4Ph3FEh37ql9Ufr","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"IBxzR5dOBgrLBhph","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"hItZXPEOGuHDaXHD","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"L3EnxyPiJL5kVYNL","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XiRZaDj4JCMvKIYR","name":"Rear Admiral Olenka Zavalle","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Despite being relegated to patrolling the fear reaches of the Outer Rim, Rear Admiral Olenka Zavalle has assembled a capable strike group by amalgamating a series of smaller patrol and security formations into a single command. A Core Worlder from a reasonably well connected family, Zavalle was a rising star within the Imperial Navy until she ran afoul of Admiral Motti while assigned to his staff. It was not long before Admiral Motti grew tired of Zavalle’s constant questioning of his assumptions and beliefs. Given Zavalle’s exemplary record, Motti’s only recourse to dispose of her was arranging a promotion to a remote posting – commander of long range patrols in the Outer Rim. Undefeated, Zavalle re-organized forces within her jurisdiction into a unique formation of fast, light, and numerous strike craft. Her fleet may not be doctrinal, but it has been wildly successful in hunting down criminals and Rebels alike.\n\nRagtag by Imperial standards, Admiral Zavalle’s strike group more closely resembles the Rebel Alliance fleet than the usual image of the Imperial Navy. Instead of being centered around a few Star Destroyers, her forces include Raider-class corvettes, Quasar Fire-class light carriers, innumerable TIEs of most variants, and a handful of Arquitens-class light cruisers.These forces are by no means heavy, but Zavalle emphasizes the strengths of her formation: flexibility, speed, and the de-centralization of capabilities. Losing any one ship will have little effect on the strike group’s combat effectiveness, unlike the hammer blow that the loss of a Star Destroyer can be in a mid-sized fleet engagement. This makes her forces a unique threat and potentially a refreshing challenge for your PCs."}},"items":[{"_id":"MaB1khreYNvBYjm5","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"mUYYvFzxQJtOLadW","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"PCUjeAYFIsSFFtDj","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"z63dhrYqjcsiCCrH","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Xk8sCpZWy4TI3A2p","name":"Fyrnock (unofficial)","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Fyrnocks are dangerous predators found on large asteroids with breathable atmospheres, and possibly other locations–but the less sunlight, the better. Xenobiologists disagree on whether fyrnocks have a deep-rooted terror of natural light, or if it damages them. Whatever the evolutionary reason, fyrnocks cannot be forced by any means, not even the Force, to enter natural sunlight. Unlike most lifeforms, they are silicone-based, not carbon-based. Fyrnocks live in large packs, which may include a much larger and stronger Mother Fyrnock."}},"items":[{"_id":"kVsQQj3YJ0Q6DJKL","name":"Teeth and claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 2, Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XknNQBPeusHw5MbP","name":"Southern Nikto","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Add 1 rank in Perception. A Southern Nikto may add :boost: to Perception and Vigilance checks to detect sound."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"Xm22huuILuJCUq0b","name":"Lando Calrissian (Dawn of Rebellion)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"wCn88BdNJ3SFfA3Y","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"os3FQ3lCBCLIn5QI","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"SH3EOb7IdrNZ1OIm","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"usdL7PR04qCaOzLY","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Uj2mk4o46fHwwBDV","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XmrTcu8pbmo1itWA","name":"Fire Control","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Take the Fire Control action; all combat checks made from current starship or vehicle count their target’s Silhouette as one higher than nor­mal until the beginning of next turn."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XnUccAeRP0xgJxP5","name":"Force Power: Enhance","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When making an Athletics check, the character may roll an Enhance power check as part of the pool and may spend :forcepip: to gain :success: or :advantage: (their choice) on the check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XrwoyNhaGaXsImVB","name":"Nikto Enforcer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Nikto, a species of reptilian humanoids, is the dominant species on Kintan. When the dying star M’dweshuu went supernova millennia ago, Kintan was flooded with massive amounts of radiation that killed most of the indigenous life on the planet. The Niktos were among the few species that survived the cataclysm. The resulting radiation exposure sped up their rate of mutation, and five distinct subspecies soon developed, each adapted to a specific region on Kintan. The Nikto subspecies share similar features, including leathery skin, sometimes covered with spikes or horns, and protective membranes that protect their eyes from the harsh Kintan climate."}},"items":[{"_id":"CsXULpVlh3CqBaue","name":"Tuskbeast pike","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Defensive 1, Knockdown"}},{"_id":"vBfTEBouCwWrozis","name":"Claws (Green Nikto only)","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"XsAz8O2BA22LIYQN","name":"Lumbering","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"May only make one Move maneuver per turn and may not take the Aim maneuver."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
