{"_id":"YRwNw6SELiysAx4G","name":"Blast","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"If the attack is successful and Blast activates, each character (friend or foe) Engaged with the original target suffers wounds equal to the weapon’s Blast rating.\n\nIf the attack misses Blast can still be activated with :advantage::advantage::advantage: causing damage to the target and all Engaged targets equal to the Blast rating of the weapon."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"YT8nUjezqgGGofSu","name":"Clone Sergeant","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Clone sergeants lead squads of nine clone troopers. Early in the war, distinctive drab-green markings on their armour identify clone sergeants on the battlefield. Sergeants generally receive their orders from clone lieutenants, although they may occasionally receive direction from a Jedi Padawan commander during unusual or unexpected circumstances."}},"items":[{"_id":"Uij3RDD36ZPyyt2F","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"VxhjSzbAQxfohHma","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"YVYudec9GtFJScYG","name":"Stormtrooper: Novatrooper","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Throughout galactic history, empires have established guard units composed of elite troops equipped with superior weapons and armour, charging them with the most daring of military missions. The elite Novatroopers of the Imperial Stormtrooper corps follow this historical convention. Their distinctive reinforced black and gold armour is symbolic of the Novatroopers’ dual role. While rarely seen except at military parades and Imperial ceremonies, these honor guards are just as capable of conducting intense combat as they are looking sharp for the Imperial HoloNet news. The Novatroopers focus on instilling intense discipline within their ranks, even more so than regular Stormtroopers. Rumors circulate in Imperial military circles of extreme feats of discipline demanded in their training, such as executing traditional parade maneuver while subjected to tear gas. No matter their training methods, would-be assassins would do well to remember these guardsmen are more than just ceremonial – they will fight expertly and to the death to protect their charge."}},"items":[{"_id":"K3PUDAtZHlBRdfK9","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"RFanFh90aBD87yxM","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"qiHsNRx6giKX984g","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"2ukpLo88DSUunKYr","name":"Ornate heavy blaster pistols","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"kFqSzdM6PSvLrBU8","name":"Ornate vibrosword","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 1, Defensive 1"}},{"_id":"kjILsLIi1wPdKKKO","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"wOA7r6QQc4S9ygCS","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"YWtWUVUF496e74JZ","name":"RT-3PO","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Brought on to aid in translations and negotiations, RT-3PO has excelled especially in running Walisi’s auctions. It is loyal and competent but scarcely a fighter, and it was lucky not to have been seriously damaged in the attack."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
