{"_id":"ZEvNj7UXAERunip1","name":"Riar Royal Guard","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Local Royal Guard Patrol Officers monitor Bog Bay for criminal activities. Though not as elite as the ones in Toydor, they can be formidable against the local criminal element. One of their most important duties is to ensure that the flight restrictions in the area are followed; they are notoriously uncompromising concerning any violations they find."}},"items":[{"_id":"lC0Wib1m3LY8GOgk","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"SuOFhOyHSXPezdNQ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZFJQRgrSV3fbwFJu","name":"Gamorrean Thug","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Gamorreans are porcine humanoids with a penchant for barbarism and thuggishness. Hailing from the Outer Rim planet of Gamorr, these violent and thoroughly dull-witted creatures would likely have never made it into the wider galaxy. However, at some point some enterprising individual realized that the Gamorreans complete unpleasantness was matched only by their utility as dumb, strong muscle. Now many individuals from crime barons to wealthy nobles employ Gamorreans as guards. They are unintelligent enough to be difficult to bribe and strong enough to be truly terrifying in a fight."}},"items":[{"_id":"f6GeB3VocjFzwywu","name":"Crude Gamorrean vibro-ax","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"UKk6L4LIHAqhajJU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZFpREKUyI4aoMMvS","name":"Brom","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Brom is a surly brute with a reputation for violence. He’s reliable, however, and clever about his brutality."}},"items":[{"_id":"oQi0eUHyKrwWJ0AJ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"LrOpQ0zaz88cNGdY","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"dlpwDYzdWgF7o1Hr","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZH5X4YBFyDtZUDKj","name":"Martial Training","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Kage Assassins use a unique weapon profile for unarmed combat."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZJE9VDaGsiMwY5Nf","name":"Big Game Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Rim’s many dangerous worlds are home to countless frightening creatures, and big game hunters prey on the largest and most menacing of these. Frequently operating at the edges of civilization, these beings explore the deepest jungles, penetrate the harshest deserts, and even venture into the bottomless depths of ocean worlds to track and kill or capture the fiercest animals known to the galaxy. Some take contracts from settlements or rancher barons to eliminate dangerous predators. Others help fill the galaxy’s fighting pits and gladiatorial arenas with a never-ending supply of exotic threats. Finally, some hunt for sport, savoring the rush of adrenaline at every kill. Big game hunters are deadly combatants, especially when circumstances require them to hunt the deadliest game: other sentients."}},"items":[{"_id":"A2STm9QJ3S1lUShr","name":"Scoped blaster rifle","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Extreme","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Sniper Shot"}},{"_id":"jSTxEkX8jUmgGqUE","name":"Oversized combat knife","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":""}},{"_id":"uFs0638fN3C4qi2R","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"W37fi8iKdCEqUzD3","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"m7pYIQ55DgrgkhT6","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZJnWE1X41uARqRgx","name":"Togruta Royal Guard","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"dLPTDqrX1raeegPa","name":"Kiavene (Melee)","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"TmwBAV5VUWVmlQ5y","name":"Kiavene (Blaster)","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":2,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 2, Limited Ammo 1"}},{"_id":"RoCTpyJdytX0SZc2","name":"Ceremonial Rifle","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":10,"critical":2,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Pierce 1, Stun Setting"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZKuzwdpUPKsfC1nh","name":"Trandoshan hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"c7HNxwNkzfFv5HYM","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"cRMnQySvTZFK4YRn","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Bralw","qualities":"Disorient 1, Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZLgXdsOxHdvRJMGi","name":"Ossus Stone Guardian","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Statues of ancient Jedi heroes were a common enough sight at Jedi Temples so as to not draw much attention. However, while most are merely statues, some conceal a secret beneath their polished stone exteriors. Jedi defence droids disguised as minimalist statues were popular in Jedi temples constructed around the time of the Qel-Droma Epics. These simple droids could remain still for millennia without maintenance, moving only when their sensors detected a threat. The powerful juggernauts would then attack all targets within their assigned area. Operating under the most basic of programming, most were unable to distinguish between friend and foe. The droids were heavily armoured and, in some cases, layers of cortosis lined the droid chassis beneath their heavy stone exteriors. Still, the droids had a built-in weakness—Jedi who thought to do so could use the Force to move a shutdown switch located within a droid’s torso."}},"items":[{"_id":"laRI6rwzqLrEAEhg","name":"Stone sword","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Cortosis, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"LW5ZdOZNhnH4oJcb","name":"Stone fists","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Cortosis, Concussive 1"}},{"_id":"OdIpt3kqPF53OOK9","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ZMsLxd40Zsyt8q0e","name":"Provincial Law Enforcement Officer","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The day-to-day enforcement of laws does not generally fall on the armoured shoulders of stormtroopers. Instead, most regions and municipalities rely on local talent, drawn from their own populations, to keep the peace, investigate criminal activity, and protect the citizenry from any threats that might arise. Though the details of their organizations and degrees of com petence are as varied as the worlds they patrol, in general, provincial law enforcement officers are lightly armed and armoured, with their most powerful weapons the comlinks they carry to call for backup when needed."}},"items":[{"_id":"gMRoky3DMwVfZpoZ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ntBeBMjF4AbaZ8RP","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
