{"_id":"ZZRfbMyjuDhAWgp9","name":"Jorec and Mard Gemen","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Jorec and Mard faithfully served King Molec, and Queen Scintel before him, as the royal archivists, but they were reassigned as registrars on Kowak to oversee the prince’s actions on behalf of the crown. The two have served as a roadblock to the prince’s youthful decadence ever since. Come auction night, the ageing brothers take every precaution to ensure a successful and profitable evening. The two are convinced the prince’s entire operation would fall down around his ears were it not for their guidance.\n\nNo-one would suspect Jorec and Mard are fraternal twins. Jorec is a large, broadly built Zygerrian who is friendly, but simple and unkempt. His brother Mard is short and wiry, and overcompensates for his less-than-intimidating stature with an abrasive attitude and meticulous grooming.\n\nWhile proud to serve the crown, Jorec and Mard resent being on a backwater to babysit the prince, whom they consider an embarrassment to the royal family. Their anger at the king has forced them to question their entire way of life. The twins’ loyalty to the crown is weakened by their burning desire to return home to Zygerria, preferably at the expense of the prince. The latter impulse can be exploited to convince them to help the Rebellion."}},"items":[{"_id":"YnLvcI3JAE9OiRED","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"5o4fv40XwhiRn2Cx","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"qC663RvswO4ZzV7x","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
