{"_id":"aCJ9uaLGSTn1JEKn","name":"Silent Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Opponents suffer :setback::setback: on any Perception or Vigilance checks made to detect a sand panther while it is hunting."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"aEF8MvElZ4tYhyHG","name":"Kath Hound","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The kath hounds of Dantooine are a species of fierce canine pack hunters, averaging about one metre tall at the shoulders. There are a number of subspecies of kath hounds, including variants with powerful, curving horns, although all are notable for their cloven hooves, thick fur, and strong jaws. Some xenobiologists attempt to categorise some varieties as more powerful or dangerous than others, but in truth, all members of the species are lethal hunters, especially when hunting alongside their pack mates. Alone or in packs, kath hounds have been trained as guard or attack animals across the galaxy for centuries. Some attempts have been made to breed or genetically engineer improved versions of the species, such as the highly aggressive and near uncontrollable salky hounds, but few real improvements have been made."}},"items":[{"_id":"2F9hZx139XA40U9P","name":"Teeth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}},{"_id":"PwED1X6dInYSdLV9","name":"Horns","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Disorient 1, Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
