{"_id":"aN1kNVEPWYPboKGz","name":"Deck Officer Lt. Nela Arseli","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Lt. Nela Arseli is one of a rotating pool of personnel serving as deck officers in Echo Base’s hangars. When on duty, she tracks and directs operations occurring within the hangar at any given time. She often helps with organising ships and vehicles as needed within the hangar to carry out their various missions and requirements, though other staff actually direct the traffic. She nominally knows who is work ing in the hangar at any given time, though in practice this only applies to those assigned to the current duty shift.\n\nLt. Arseli joined the Rebellion on Dantooine, serving at that base until it was relocated. She has since served in many smaller bases in a variety of roles, enabling her to meet many more pilots and personnel than the average Rebel. She has a sharp memory and runs an efficient hangar."}},"items":[{"_id":"tfIVlkMwlMd3lpUf","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"aOgOOZ4sLHzvLoqT","name":"Twin Bond","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When Tiplee and Tiplar are within Short range of each other and one of them suffers voluntary strain, the other may suffer some or all of the strain instead."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"aQKvDbh8Gj0aanSH","name":"M226 Navy Trooper","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Navy troopers assigned to the Perlemian Haul’s freighters are pulled from some of the Imperial Navy’s best personnel. As such, they are highly motivated and willing to die for the Empire if need be. A group of four of these troopers, commanded by Petty Ofhcer Wen, is assigned to provide security in M226’s loading bay."}},"items":[{"_id":"oHX3kmx1OMDbzIYX","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
