{"_id":"dfaMUnqhXg4YgQE0","name":"Gorn Vorrox","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Corn himself is a fairly average-looking male Duros, slightly less than two meters tall, with blue-green skin and bright red eyes. Outwardly friendly, Corn is an opportunist, swindler, and skilled negotiator. The merchant drives a hard bargain and almost never gives anvthine awav for free."}},"items":[{"_id":"ZKVu7rFJ9yhr2vPr","name":"Scattergun blaster stashed behind counter","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Blast 4"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"dfgQIK2qPcZnYbka","name":"Mature Hutt","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The majority of Hutts encountered throughout the galaxy are adult Hutts, ranging in age from 91 to 844. Adult Hutts on Nal Hutta can be found in a large number of colors. While the “traditional” Hutt coloration is an olive shade, there are many Hutts whose color ation is wildly different. Deep purples, ruddy oranges, and even dark blues are not unheard of on a Hutt.\n\nIt is also common for Hutts to have skin that is mottled or patterned, often in contrasting colors. A purple-skinned Hutt might have an elaborate pattern of white or grey across its back, for instance. Some Hutts even tattoo themselves with clan markings to further enhance their appearance."}},"items":[{"_id":"wIkxJeMFfSzTRPZw","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"AaZ0m9oYUrTs96q9","name":"Large-bore laster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":2,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"hH6LmBqRieppEc3M","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"uCTzIuoFvkQkDnUJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"xvRi4QUbFzNT884T","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"dgFsaFCF1KUjdu2V","name":"Dagoyan Meditation","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per day, Queen Julia may spend two hours in deep moving meditation. Once complete, her Force Rating increases to 3 for the remainder of the day."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
