{"_id":"e0eBgURVP8OrG3JC","name":"Yiyar Clan Members","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Most Yiyar clan members are self-centred or, at best, focused on internal politics and power struggles. Yav’s associates are loyal to him and see the *Sa Nalaor* as a huge opportunity to raise their status. Four serve aboard the *Nightflyer*, and a dozen more live on the Wheel and operate the Yiyar Salvage cargo bay, auctions, and sales."}},"items":[{"_id":"Z8hJTAxwZJqSAr2W","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Nx6D9LhNIvcsfXDx","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"e5W1iSuqLqbMS9TA","name":"Force Power: Seek","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Spend :forcepip::forcepip: to gain insight into the general location or direction of a person or object that he knows about, regardless of current distance. Spend :forcepip: and succeed at an :average: Vigilance check (or opposed Vigilance vs. Discipline check) to see through illusions."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"e8T7p1AS8iSySbMD","name":"Kath Scarlet","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Kath Scarlet is the captain of the Binayre Pirates, a small band of pirates operating in the Corellian Sector after the rise of the Empire. She earned her position of power by elevating the Binayre from a small-time swoop gang in the slums of Corellia to a full-fledged pirate organization. Her group has since grown significantly in size, but are still poorly regarded – even among the galactic underworld. This is due primarily to Kath’s reputation as an utterly ruthless pirate, double-crossing her employers and allies without a second thought when the credits are right. Her brazen and backstabbing approach to business is the responsible for the Binayre’s rapid rise to power but may also lead to its early demise.\n\nPersonality: Kath projects what she thinks of as a rakish air – reckless, vicious, and impertinent. However, beneath her audacious front lies a cunning and treacherous mind. Scarlet grew up in the worst areas of Coronet City on Corellia and feels entirely justified in taking nearly any action, no matter how nefarious, to ensure she keeps what little status she has amassed. She is capable of clever planning and isn’t afraid to bite off more than she can chew if she believes the reward outweighs the risks.\n\nTactics: Under Scarlet’s leadership, the Binayre mainly focus on hitting lightly guarded or unarmed ships throughout the Corellian Sector. Her starships and supplies are precious, and she won’t risk them unless the potential rewards are worth it. Intent on squeezing every last bit of profit from each prize, Scarlet often steals and fences both the ship and its cargo and has even been known to sell the target’s crew into slavery. This brutal and mercenary approach has given her a bad reputation, even among other pirate crews."}},"items":[{"_id":"54Ma6alRHPXQ6kfc","name":"Heavy blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting, Inaccurate 1"}},{"_id":"UoWPanKMAEll09LR","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Jh0XdFR2b3BDV5xC","name":"Debilitating Shot","type":"talent","system":{"description":"Upon successful attack with a starship or vehicle weapon, may spend :advantage::advantage: to reduce the target’s maximum Speed by 1 until the end of the next round","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"gLLjefYb6Mi7d5vZ","name":"Overwhelm Defenses","type":"talent","system":{"description":"(Upon successful attack with a starship or vehicle weapon, may spend :advantage::advantage: per rank of Overwhelm Defenses to reduce the defence in the targeted zone by 1 for each :advantage::advantage: spent","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"e8ivg5MS1WR9uyag","name":"Bad Knee","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"If TH-313 generates :threat::threat::threat: or :despair: on an Athletics, Brawl, or Melee check, he is immobilised for one round."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"e9hC7aX5UqbBEulg","name":"Draw Closer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Perform Draw Closer action; make a Lightsaber (Willpow­er) combat check against one Silhouette 1 target within Medium range, adding :force: no greater than Force rating to check. Spend :forcepip: to move target one range band closer or to add :success: to check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"eAHncqYm7qRSunNV","name":"Ruping","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The soaring rupings of Onderon are graceful, noble reptavians that have been trained as flying mounts for generations on their homeworld. Thinner than the Alderaanian thranta, rupings were used both as scouts and battle mounts in the Battle of Onderon during the Clone Wars. Capable of flying to great heights, rupings have two sets of eyes that can focus on both predator and prey simultaneously, giving them exceptional situational awareness. Often rupings alert to danger long before their riders do, and are rarely caught off guard."}},"items":[{"_id":"irAhvjtablqWCGto","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
