{"_id":"ehLGovVFDD6b0Pjn","name":"Natural Pilot","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per session, may reroll any one Piloting: Space or Gunnery check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ejCNxVm88alDMYuN","name":"Krykna","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Often referred to as a spider, the two metre tall krykna is unlike most arachnids. While it shares a similar appearance and a limited ability to create webbing, the krykna possesses only six limbs and cannot generate venom. Its vertically-orientated body is pale and fleshy, but surprisingly resistant to blaster fire. The creature’s terrifying visage features two large, glassy black eyes atop a beaked mouth flanked by twitching mandibles.\n\nKrykna thrive and lay eggs within the tunnels in and under the massive rocky coral growths covering Atollon’s surface. They only venture out to search for food, subsisting on skittish dokma snails, though the krykna are willing to dine on anything that stinks of fear. Far from invincible, krykna have an intense aversion to the radiation emitted from standard sensor markers, allowing base personnel to erect an invisible barricade that keeps them out."}},"items":[{"_id":"KLFPR7zOtJzek2iF","name":"Pincer","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 1, Knockdown"}},{"_id":"PXOktgiP6amDTaNG","name":"Webbing","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":1,"critical":3,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Ensnare 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ejxIWfxDJpBYb9iG","name":"Evarrian Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Evarrian hunters are four metre-long insectoids with hundreds of flexible body segments that propel them through the soft mud and water of the swamp effortlessly. Their upper bodies sport two long claws coated in paralytic venom that quickly immobilizes their prey. The carapace of the creature is a deep purple with streaks of pale blue along the back. Multifaceted eyes and two long antennae provide excellent sight and tracking for the creature."}},"items":[{"_id":"6qfltypX0lA3NYP2","name":"Spiked forelegs","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Defensive 1, Linked 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
