{"_id":"fbQw9b1NsHVNYU18","name":"Pale Nikto","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Add 1 rank in Athletics. A Pale Nikto never suffers movement penalties for travelling through water and can hold his breath for a number of rounds equal to twice his Brawn rating before beginning to drown."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"feWkP5LDdHw40LKF","name":"Force Mimic","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"At the GM’s discretion, the kaaten may make an opposed Charm or Deception versus Vigilance check as an action to pretend to be a friend, companion, loved one, or of the same spe­cies as its target. When doing so, add :force: to the check; :lightside: results add :success: to Charm checks, while :darkside: results add :success: to Deception checks. If the check succeeds, the illusion is successful, though what effect this has on gameplay depends on the situation and can be determined by the GM. Targets immune to Force powers are immune to these effects."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fedywVoXKsTB9Rzu","name":"BX Commando Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Relics of the Separatist droid army of the Clone Wars, BX-series commando droids served as infiltrators and assassins. More cunning, skilled, durable, and dangerous than the more common BI battle droids, commando droids were more expensive to produce, and their use was thus limited to vital missions and support duties.\n\nWhile their less deadly counterparts are still seen occasionally across the galaxy, serving at the behest of criminals and mercenaries, active commando droids are, thankfully, all but unheard of in current times."}},"items":[{"_id":"T9dvd1YIiptClV9d","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"1vIHhpxkrftE0DoK","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Wjaf1ECIUmJWvLoC","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"WzZDGhhZrTWEJrVQ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
