{"_id":"fg6AUZJSaHmY6U1U","name":"Arboreal Octopus","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The arboreal octopus is a multi-tentacled horror that lives in the upper canopy of the forest. It descends to the lower branches to ambush its prey from above. Pack hunters that rely on stealth and agility, the octopi wrap themselves around large tree trunks or solid tree limbs and ensnare unwitting prey as it passes below. Once an arboreal octopus has grabbed its victim, it tries to haul it up to a higher perch to eat its meal.\n\nThe arboreal octopus is a mottled brown-green colour, ideally suited for concealing itself among the tree trunks and branches. Its skin is flexible but difficult to pierce. Its central body is round and less flexible and covered in heavy fur and thick hairs. The octopus is difficult to sneak up on, as it has four eyes distributed evenly around the centre of its body and a pair of eyes at the top of its head. Its mouth, centred on its ventral side, sports pointed, razor-sharp teeth.\n\nFour of its tentacles are used primarily for climbing and moving about. These possess spikes and short claws along their lengths, enabling the creature to latch on and keep an impossibly tight hold on its perch. The other three tentacles are used mainly for hunting. Each ends in a triple-pronged talon for injuring its prey as it captures it. The tentacle also secretes a sticky substance along its length that helps hold prey while the octopus moves from limb to limb."}},"items":[{"_id":"Z3icFwIhQ2Duw4K8","name":"Four climbing tentacles","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 1"}},{"_id":"M3gVaQXSeDqeJ5Jw","name":"Three hunting tentacles","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 2, Linked 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fi0BnGppBpPPVcfQ","name":"Trample","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"If the creature takes a maneuver to move closer to its target before attacking, it gains :boost: to its attack check and deals +2 damage."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fo7wzws28ji6sZxe","name":"Heavy Gan","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"H1bN3riqJ4RXqCuQ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ZA9iTBsdjUSDQxtT","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fsqR5c67k1pcmuw4","name":"Shields Up","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As a maneuver, a minion group of three or more Clone Riot Troopers can increase the Defence bonus granted by their M3 bulwark blast shields to 4. This effect lasts until they either use a subsequent maneuver to move or the number of minions in the group falls below three. They may not make Melee attack rolls whilst this ability is in effect."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ft9AIycyDi1HfjhI","name":"Sentinel Shuttle","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"3JkZFot7pIHlKk2A","name":"Twin light blaster cannons","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":4,"range":"Close","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":"Linked 1"}},{"_id":"xHJAu6KLYDVwhxB7","name":"Twin light laser cannons","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Close","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":"Linked 1"}},{"_id":"w2Z1FyIXquhtQaQc","name":"Retractable light blaster cannons","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":4,"range":"Close","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":"Linked 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fuO1qI51Wjkid0vs","name":"Aquatic Creature","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Suffers no penalties for moving through water and can breathe underwater, but cannot move or survive on land."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fux2Fz4od6e7IyUI","name":"Interchangeable Weapon","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"May spend a maneuver to switch modes on their DC-17m blaster."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"fvjCJM6KiBGFOht8","name":"Damaged Basilisk","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"In the ancient days of the Mandalorian Wars, the Mandalorians rode into battle on nightmarish war droids called Basilisks. More sentient than most droids, Basilisks were heavily armed and could even fly through space. Most were destroyed when the Mandalorians lost the war thousands of years ago, and most of the galaxy has mercifully forgotten they exist."}},"items":[{"_id":"mTMPITevU1C1PpQh","name":"Claw","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Vicious 1"}},{"_id":"7b7utyU0lkVjBWBe","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"GdZt6RTfLd3fvFTM","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Ir3FcDDQg7dNSyqi","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
