{"_id":"izGa656R464oUn1J","name":"Mimbanese Resistance Fighter","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Hardened guerrilla fighters, the soldiers of the Mimbanese Liberation Army have been fighting since the waning days of the Clone War. These resistance fighters originally fought alongside the 224th clone infantry division “Mud Jumpers” against the Separatist droid menace. With the Republic replaced by the brutal Empire, the Mimbanese are locked in bloody campaign of independence. Using old Republic equipment, these guerrillas ironically are faced with the 224th Imperial Armoured Division, an Imperial Army formation perpetuating the history of the once-allied “Mud Jumpers.” While the Mimbanese may be under-equipped, they posses far more experience and resolve than their Imperial Army opponents."}},"items":[{"_id":"gD0cEa3427BGla4Y","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"8BMfHuTI1LPeWp4Q","name":"Vibrobayonet","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 3"}},{"_id":"s9NsgqrLnpVIoEPH","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"69zhNXOm2t4Xtfl4","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
