{"_id":"kG6JcH3T83kSuTOa","name":"Nightbrother","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Like all Nightbrothers, these Zabrak males seem to exist only to serve the Nightsisters. When Jerserra returned to Dathomir, this local tribe quickly came to her side to fight off any who would oppose her."}},"items":[{"_id":"eJU53EwU49Wdse4t","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"SdB42ANs0ufoi1lU","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kIMf5fr5PWwF904q","name":"Numa","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"More than even Cham Syndulla, Numa’s life has been consumed by warfare-and like Cham, she has little love for outsiders after having being betrayed by her former liberators. As a child, she was rescued by Republic clone troopers during the Clone Wars. Her admiration for those seemingly heroic soldiers was destroyed when the Empire rose to power. Men she had affectionally called “nerra”, or brother, as a child turned their weapons on her and put her in bonds. After agents of the newly formed Free Ryloth Movement rescued her, Numa came to distrust outsiders, perhaps even more so than her mentor, Cham Syndulla. Her dedication, ingenuity, and natural aptitude with explosive devices led her to her meteoric rise among the freedom fighters, until she became one of Cham’s most trusted agents. Her commitment to the Free Ryloth Movement is matched only by her lingering sense of loss and betrayal. Though she rarely speaks and has a public persona of aloof coldness, Numa cares deeply about Ryloth and its people."}},"items":[{"_id":"0ncEA85Lk0SlUSMa","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"C69CJfV52UhG3ksH","name":"Frag grenade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":4,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Blast 8, Limited Ammo 1"}},{"_id":"ZHa6qGq7l5zjQW8p","name":"Armour-piercing grenade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":13,"critical":4,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Blast 6, Limited Ammo 1, Pierce 3"}},{"_id":"c8IVq2sHEKbUrD2q","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"LAnXqivY6umvQ0BD","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kKMIcwmLYkAbrorX","name":"Dagoyan Master","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Dagoyan Masters spend years in intense study and meditation before achieving a state in which they are worthy of the title “Master.” There are only a few dozen Dagoyan Masters every generation, and only twelve of them can sit on the council at any time. The others spend their time teaching and leading various Dagoyan mystic communities.\n\nDagoyan Masters do not typically engage in combat. Infact, they will use their connection with the Force to avoid it whenever possible, viewing conflict as a sad artifact from Bardotta’s distant past."}},"items":[{"_id":"XFGWGKADtWxvsKby","name":"Walking stick","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Disorient 1"}},{"_id":"FCW11LPeTq7scEOe","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"e7F0W9xTfdY0iqO8","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kKcmOgQdQzTuJIMz","name":"Naboo Royal Handmaiden","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"tdKXlORH0akPK5fz","name":"ELG-3A blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"6","critical":"4","range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"IiAJVxKwuBWacTKS","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kLTX7H419D7i7op1","name":"Spade-Headed Smooka","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A tiny, vicious winged predator, the spade-headed smooka is one of the few species comfortable in both the canopy and the lower swamps. Itself popular prey for larger animals, it feasts on insects, eggs, and young rodents.\n\nSpade-headed smookas grow no more than ten centimetres long, and their appearance, which many beings find adorable, means they are often underestimated. Their large, flat heads and deep-brown eyes, combined with their furry bodies, give smookas the look of a potential pet. However, no smooka has ever been domesticated. Their bite, which is extremely painful, can tear through most kinds of armour and the bars of many cages.\n\nSmookas dwell in caves and the hollow trunks of long-dead gnarltrees. They roost upside down in flocks that can number in the hundreds, and typically hunt at night."}},"items":[{"_id":"CylF4O9MzO6Wyayq","name":"Rodent teeth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kLxc9tjzbDfjqh2p","name":"Jakku Scavenger","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The desert wastes of Jakku are unforgiving to all but the most hardy sorts. Those who can scrape a living from the wrecks buried in the sand are tough, solitary figures."}},"items":[{"_id":"eFkJd0zxXJduzmWy","name":"Hunting knife","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":""}},{"_id":"UqrJzrJbyNI2zyuu","name":"Longshot blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Extreme","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"hxFNOS8RTBuciuy0","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kQentgKh3Wu2uEki","name":"Bridge Guard","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Outside of the Savrips that make up the Queen’s praetorians, the guards maintaining security on the bridge are the most trusted and capable troops. They are steadfast and loyal, and they have pledged to give their lives in her defense. Each of the bridge guards wears a special grey armoured uniform with black trim, and a plain black mnask that also functions as a pair of scanning goggles."}},"items":[{"_id":"wfuCABmmJ8Bw6dWD","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"6lJFTpknm8jLWYfm","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"kT3Q2CKwjys0D5SM","name":"Fenn Sesslyn","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A native of Corellia, Fenn Sesslyn is the no-nonsense commander of SoroSuub’s corporate security operation in G’rinn Go City. Of medium height and build, with long limbs and a fierce demeanor, she has been with SoroSuub for more than a decade now. Her ambition and blunt manner of speaking have made her quite a few enemies within the company and corporate security. Her inability to sugarcoat bad news or to be lenient with employees breaking the law is what landed her current position. While most see G’rinn Go City as a career-ending assignment, Commander Sesslyn has worked tirelessly to ensure that her officers are the most efficient, well-trained, and well-respected officers in the company."}},"items":[{"_id":"936SFjnLz7CsfRQm","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"iKZ7RDXzSRw95C80","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"rIgsOQ6VBUAl0ayY","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"upKTXzLAwvtTUTQ5","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"WURsbhqhzPlDk5Ip","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"2cLepwb6felNMRj1","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"2MiMqXaQw4GKkxgi","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
