{"_id":"laI1ofHe1H97hnmz","name":"Fyrnock","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Evolved from the same morphology as the pesky mynocks, fyrnocks are silicon-based quadrupedal life forms that feed on electrical energy. Whole not nearly as common as their winged cousins, fyrnocks pose an even greater threat thanks to their eagerness to feed on the bio-electricity most life forms possess.\n\nReadily identified by their leather purple– to brown-hued skin and glowing yellow eyes, fyrnocks also have razor-sharp claws and teeth evolved to penetrate ship hulls and generator housings. Fyrnocks never stop growing, reaching gargantuan sizes if populations spread unchecked. This is problematic, because they breed like womp rats; several fyrnocks can multiply and overrun a cruiser in days."}},"items":[{"_id":"XchN2fDSiMWiLCE5","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3"}},{"_id":"9auZ87nUrF21TScj","name":"Teeth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"lgKsdIjKkcnim8Jg","name":"Falling Avalanche","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per round, suffer 2 Strain to add {Brawn} to damage of one successful Lightsaber combat check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"lgNUl2fOgXnAdjRM","name":"Sullustan Resistance Fighter","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The members of the Sullustan Resistance are some of the most dedicated and tenacious freedom fighters in the galaxy. The organization of their cells and the ways in which they have gone about the business of attacking their oppressors have inspired the organisation and tactics of the Rebel Alliance. All beings who throw their lot in with the Alliance owe the Sullustans a debt of gratitude. Allied with, but not officially part of, the Alliance to Restore the Republic, members of the Sullustan Resistance are among the best allies to have at one’s back when the chips are down."}},"items":[{"_id":"RQ5DCW4rTTj7MS8d","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"SjhUihtYSYAMHwTv","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"F4C0LyaHGlyJAbkc","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
