{"_id":"lgzu6TJuXfaZ6h3d","name":"Chell “Cold Case” Wi’eeda, Journeyman Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Background: Born to an enslaved family of Tibanna gas miners on the Hutt controlled world of Sleheyron, Chell spent most of her youth dreaming of escaping the miserable living and working conditions of her family. Before long, she lost both parents (her mother died in an accident, and her father was sold without notice) and was forced to make her own way. Unfortunately, there are few opportunities for a slave child, least of all in Hutt controlled space.\n\nChell began to inform on other slaves to earn her meals and eventually turned to tracking escapees full-time once she bought her freedom. Now a fully licensed bounty hunter, Chell primarily patrols Hutt space (though she will still take Imperial contracts on criminals seeking refuge in the Hutt’s domain). She hasn’t brought in any high-profile targets yet, but her track record for recovering escaped slaves with icy detachment has earned her the nickname “Cold Case” – a moniker and reputation she has embraced by christening her first starship with it.\n\nChell has a well-earned reputation for pitiless, professional detachment. The conditions of her childhood taught her that she couldn’t trust anyone and she would need to be ruthless to survive into adulthood. As a result, she rarely partners with other hunters and has trained a pack of Corellian hounds to assist her on hunts. She takes excellent care of her hounds and shows them more affection than she has ever shown another sentient being"}},"items":[{"_id":"bbGjE7PCnxnYFEWr","name":"Blastech M-300 Hunting Blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Extreme","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Accurate 1, Cumbersome 2, Pierce 2, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"BpxHmvRPaSeFJKii","name":"KDY-21 Light blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Short","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"GnJ2JyXRoezQMNfK","name":"StunMaster Shock Prod","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Stun Damage, Disorient 2"}},{"_id":"ScDanXGRR5zia1Ds","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"z9qmpGozf1Ul2edv","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6EFvJspzPPoOaKNv","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"lh6nCegqQfhQGrEu","name":"First Order Riot Trooper","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"In the subdued worlds within First Order territory, stormtroopers act as a first line of control and authority. When dealing with rebellious or unruly populations, stormtroopers come prepared with non-lethal riot gear in the form of riot control batons and shields."}},"items":[{"_id":"XDcHLFyXdah5hvzs","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"vU8lEZe1uNiGIUvk","name":"Shock baton","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Disorient 3, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"wZI9PvhOpJorPbbF","name":"Riot shield","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Defensive 2, Deflection 1"}},{"_id":"HmB4yXEXShRntuHP","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"NU8ztV42eFhcOsa3","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"liYzFqdlvLHcmGSv","name":"Loan Shark","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"There will always be those in need of money in the galaxy and there will always be others who are happy to lend it to them in exchange for a promise of repayment plus interest. Loan sharks are typically individuals with significant wealth at their disposal but who are never content with what they have. This leads them to loan their money to others at such a rate that they get back at least half again what was loaned. The people to whom they loan their money are desperate and have nowhere else to turn, but loan sharks care little about the details. They simply want their money returned or they want to see those who default on their loans punished in the most demonstrative way possible."}},"items":[{"_id":"G5p8iN1EWffVxOGL","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"ADDL3LlqihUK2SHk","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"t5gv6GulhAnC9OWj","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"G9edulH2wl2kakVj","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"JPiZPwVBIA1VKqoT","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
