{"_id":"mSb4lrXx5znmxqgA","name":"Binayre Pirate","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Even amongst pirates and smugglers, the Binayre are considered scum. The core members of the pirate crew cut their teeth as swoop gangers on the streets of Corellia and are consequently willing to kill, steal, and betray to hold onto the limited wealth and luxury they have acquired. The crew is a motley collection of species, but all are decent pilots and practiced killers. However, Kath is certainly the brains and talent behind their success and they all know it. As a result, she commands great loyalty among the gang, making her possibly the only one in the galaxy who these ruffians wouldn’t stab in the back."}},"items":[{"_id":"tteF1XOapOsLBV7J","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"Z7x3xGMHaycVNMAP","name":"Stun baton","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Stun, Disorient 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
