{"_id":"nzm0q3KHuc5te6Um","name":"Polis Massa Base Squadron Pilot","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The starfighter pilots assigned to Polis Massa are a diverse mix of humans and non-humans from all across the galaxy. Some joined up after their planet was attacked or occupied by the Empire; others were Imperial pilots who sickened of the totalitarian regime and defected; while others simply joined up for the thrill of space combat. Each one has lost someone dear to them to the phantoms of the 481 st, and every one of them is itching to pay the perpetrators back in kind."}},"items":[{"_id":"5Mb5l34NBScIY72p","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o0761sRdW71mvwDo","name":"Force Protection","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As a maneuver, May suffer 1 Strain and commit a number of :force: no greater than Force Rating or ranks of Force Protection. Increase Soak by :force: committed. Spend 1 Strain at the beginning of each turn in which :force: remain committed."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o1CkymyQ2f4tyGg6","name":"Emperor’s Hand","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"One of the Emperor’s Hands would be the most horrifying, panic-inducing opponent that an individual could face–if anyone knew that the Emperor’s Hands existed. fortunately for the Hands, however, they are completely unknown to the galaxy at large and, in many cases, even to each other; more than one member of the Hands believes that he or she is the only Emperor’s Hand, which is how the Emperor prefers his operatives to operate. The Emperor’s Hands operate in absolute secrecy, often sent on missions by the Emperor himself. Members of the Emperor’s Hands almost invariably possess Force abilities and the will to use them."}},"items":[{"_id":"zChWZArH7tdDyTLc","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"kZcW5IXJyCMXCpn8","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"o6bwf2VCSJKQn6si","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"PRV9kuP2p8rH0ZQD","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ANd2QXhykJPvrYpQ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ZAiaYf5QhMKjQrG9","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"aWchuzpa17nPuLQq","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"08MScD1Kmb9VYyFe","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o1YFUw26kFRbOWFS","name":"Manka Cat","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"KiliG9EdboIJ5an9","name":"Tusks and teeth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o1llMRYid6RjTbFi","name":"Chandrilan Citizen","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Usually found in a group of two or more, the average Chandrilan citizen is often engaged in intense debate. The better arguments draw small crowds that join in on either side. The average city dweller on Chandrila has in-depth knowledge of local and galactic issues and a keen interest in politics."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o4UdIxVL3rcpIyre","name":"Black Claw Saboteur","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Ashern, also called the Black Claws, have been a part of Thyferra for decades. This radical group of Vratix freedom fighters was ultimately responsible for the Thriving Season, a ten-year period during the Separatist Crisis during which the Vratix reclaimed control of bacta production from the cartels. When the Emperor returned governmental control of Thyferra to the Xucphra and Zaltin corporations, the Ash ern resurfaced. They have plagued the Bacta Cartels ever since, sabotaging production lines, bombing shipping platforms, and stealing alazhi shipments. Ashern agents often sharpen their claws and dye their carapaces matte black."}},"items":[{"_id":"SGacgmzdInkfFemY","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"TvN020lvpxtGYA4H","name":"Black claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Vicious 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o5AA9dIT0yISd1aA","name":"Teamwork","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Add :boost: to all checks during combat while within Medium range of one or more clone trooper allies."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"o5WcHih235fKdYPN","name":"Hard Headed (Improved)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"May use the Hard Headed action to recover from being Incapacitated due to exceeding Strain Threshold. On the turn after being Incapacitated the character may make a :formidable: Discipline check, if successful their Strain decreases to one below their Strain Threshold. The difficulty of this check decreases by one per rank, to a minimum of :easy:."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
