{"_id":"oAB1xgpqvJPJtZBm","name":"Saboteur Medical Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"FX-series and 2-1 B medical droids wield a variety of surgical scalpels and syringes filled with useful chemicals for interrogations. These saboteur models have been equipped with a potent anaesthetic injector to deal with organic resistance."}},"items":[{"_id":"9FclbSsbkpJxHMrh","name":"Vibroscalpel","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":2,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 1"}},{"_id":"tjdZq1whGqVOAoms","name":"Anaesthetic injector","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Medicine","qualities":"Stun Damage"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oBEk8KGT9I7d4yQc","name":"Known Schematic","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per session, may perform the Known Schematic maneuver; make a :hard: Knowledge (Education) check; success grants familiarity with a building or ship’s design."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oBV2pK7k1CNEMVRg","name":"Mutant Felucian","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"hVdsQGGTOdvyU3oz","name":"Bone blade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2"}},{"_id":"yjiOjAmNEuyU8b4q","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"7DJs6BBpIdjH9Ez0","name":"Natural Force Blast","type":"talent","system":{"description":"Felucian Scout has +2 Force Rating for Unleash Force Power only.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oHRe4ItaA9t6Sgza","name":"Dark Hunter","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Dark Hunters were likely once members of a predatory simian species, but dark side adepts transformed them into something different. They retain their aggressive instincts and pack tactics, but they no longer hunt solely for food. Instead, these creatures revel in the act of destruction. Weighing in at more than sixty kilograms each, the bow-legged beasts stand over three meters tall and have huge arms with grasping, clawed hands. Their bodies weep with open sores, and hornlike bone spurs jut out at odd angles in numerous locations. Dark Hunters appear to be in constant pain. It may be that their violent tendencies are a response to that agony."}},"items":[{"_id":"WF7LJk226yf3ow1B","name":"Teeth and claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Burn 2"}},{"_id":"QV2nixEOqIrZ0dS0","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oIQMKKhGGkdb1CQQ","name":"Roche J9 Worker Drone","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Despite its capabilities, the J9 worker drone was an abject commercial failure. Designed as a protocol droid, the series’ moniker, “worker drone,” was deceptive to potential customers, who assumed it was just another labor droid. In addition, the unit’s appearance, which was distinctly bug-like, in conjunction with its flat personality, turned many mammalian species off. The Verpine even attempted to market the droid to other insectoid species, still without much success.\n\nMost of the J9 worker drones purchased by the public were placed in labor jobs, wasting their more advanced systems and programming on menial tasks. Because of this, J9s are some of the most intelligent labor droids on the market. Over time, however, they develop somewhat bitter personalities, as they feel they were destined for something greater but were somehow cheated out of it.\n\nThe Rebel Alliance has acquired a large number of surplus J9 worker drones directly from Roche and has put them to good use. The Alliance realizes that the J9 is much more than a simple labor droid, and many of the units have been assigned to Rebel teams to assist them with translation and analysis. So far, the majority of these J9s have been a success in the field."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oIS4nCvCahVdhDJY","name":"Terellian Jango Jumper","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As a maneuver, Cassie may leap to any location within Short range. In addition, her natural reflexes grant her +1 defense."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oJsaA669V418g8A2","name":"Surgeon’s Aid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When a minion group of one or more Mini-Meds performs the Assist maneuver to help a character with a Medicine check, that character counts as having +1 rank in the Surgeon talent per Mini-Med in the group."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oQAwCH5LNy3Rgt9m","name":"Tactical Assassin Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"OjUVJ6Oz96mAIwaM","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"uRf1L6ePe97dM07r","name":"Integral wrist blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oThCvzZAk4EXu4jc","name":"Zirkonn’s ISB Strike Team","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These men and women make up the bulk of Zirkonn’s forces that she uses when she needs some tactical combat muscle. They are well trained, well paid, hardened agents from the Imperial Security Bureau."}},"items":[{"_id":"VQLeHwC5uzaXEkk5","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"PiPVbaLbT0H5e1fq","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oU4uP0ubReqVWb57","name":"Tojo, Veteran Clone Trooper","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Jayk, Rafe and Tojo are the last remaining “rank-and-file” clone troopers in the platoon. As generalists, they are the backbone of the group, providing mobile firepower while Zeke gives orders and Oake lays down a heavy field of fire. While Jayk is the smart aleck of the group and Tojo is level-headed and stable under fire, Rafe is generally dour, pessimistic, and easily aggrevated."}},"items":[{"_id":"51KyoBB3uUVUSkGE","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"RAYFgHyBuLpoNteH","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"YVaFTLHA7lULVbsE","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"BUs08fSYFMj5V4o4","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oUWlkeK5DsAI6vUT","name":"Insurgent Leader","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Onderon Resistance members gain :boost: to Cool and Stealth checks when in Steela’s presence."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oX9JZQ5IANMWonPH","name":"Terentatek","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"uJrBYnUAhITL7Meb","name":"Poisonous tusks and claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 4, Stun 5, Vicious 4"}},{"_id":"DMZJOQ0f0l998NCZ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oXRbSv0VMGBX3heT","name":"General Veers","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"KKkgqo1eapL75JFg","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"KLlEJamSZzgQ23ct","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ociwnHCTbEnx9Hsq","name":"Field Commander (Improved)","type":"talent","system":{"description":"As an action, may make an :average: Leadership check. If he succeeds six minion groups may immediately suffer 1 Strain to perform one maneuver as an out-of-turn incidental. Spend :triumph: to allow one of those groups to perform an action instead.","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oXkVnVMjCO4hioux","name":"Malau Jocaos, Imperial intelligence Agent","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A brash man with a disarming smile, Malau Jocaos’s friendly outward demeanour belies his true nature. Under the surface, Jocaos is a cold-blooded killer who will do anything in the service of the Empire. A rising star in the Imperial Intelligence Service, Malau successfully turned Var Narek into an Imperial asset and also maintains a number of spies among the populace of Ord Radama, watching for signs of Rebels.\n\nMalau Jocaos was born on Ord Radama, a youth during the Clone Wars when the world sided with the Separatists. His parents raised him on tales of the corrupt Republic and hypocritical Jedi who had forsaken their oaths toward the common people. Raised on a steady stream of propaganda and anti-Republic dogma, Malau embraced the strict tenets of Palpatine’s New Order with zeal. As soon as he was able, Jocaos left Ord Radama and entered the Imperial Academy.\n\nThe instructors at the Academy saw great potential in Malau, fast-tracking him for enlistment into the highly selective Intelligence Service. Jocaos quickly rose through the ranks of this agency, and soon his superiors dispatched him to carry out a number of secret projects for the IIS. Returning to his home-world of Ord Radama, Malau Jocaos worked under orders to bring agents onboard who could infiltrate the Rebellion and expose its secrets. Long suspecting that his former schoolmate Var Narek had joined the Rebellion, Jocaos masterminded the bombing of Var’s brother’s shop to set Var back on the true path.\n\nMalau has great disdain for Governor Orgraal, seeing him as nothing more than a low-level politician and not worthy of his post. Jocaos plans to govern Ord Radama himself one day."}},"items":[{"_id":"lZ5StUZ3ywF0Ysuy","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"yKz4vTjG60beRGAa","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"3XAR9wocJn6FHUjJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"oZmKgpWgYitnv5jS","name":"M226 Navy Crewman","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The crew of M226 are typical Navy personnel with very little to set them apart from their peers on other ships. They are hard-working and loyal, but aren’t extraordinary in any way. They tend to work in groups of 3 or 4 individuals. Each one wears a grey Navy jumpsuit."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ob4F3PEwxq8npJpo","name":"Methane Breather","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Requires methane to live and must wear a special pressure suit. Treats standard planetary air pressure and composition as a corrosive atmosphere with rating 6."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
