{"_id":"pEcCwpxSKRtjvawu","name":"Sorority Crew","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The crew who staffs the Sorority’s ships are all experienced pirates. Though they aren’t usually called upon to participate in boarding operations, they are expected to defend their ships to the best of their ability when enemies successfully attack. The vast majority of these individuals are unarmed unless previously equipped with blasters by their individual quartermasters, which is typically only done if their ship is expected to be boarded. As the Consortium counterattack was unexpected, most of them will not have blasters."}},"items":[{"_id":"o0Jr92Eg9xe12nQ8","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"pGfsa6cNy0gsYz2P","name":"Cracian Thumper","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Exported from Craci in the Corporate Sector, Cracian thumpers have become one of the most widespread riding animals in the galaxy. These bipedal herbivores bear features resembling a mix between that of a large rodent and a horse, and sport sharp claws on both their forelimbs and large, powerful hind legs. They have long faces with broad snouts and upright ears. There are numerous breeds of Cracian thumpers, primarily distinguished between long- and short-hair varieties. The former are well-suited to colder environments, resembling the tauntauns of Hoth. Despite their name, Cracian thumpers naturally move with great stealth, making them ideal mounts for Rebel Beast Riders."}},"items":[{"_id":"y5yiLHaTmpHzqsAu","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}},{"_id":"tP4sdnUhZt3t1bGE","name":"Tail","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":5,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Disorient 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
