{"_id":"peY63OtLKhh4Do1J","name":"Spectre 4: Garazeb “Zeb” Orrelios","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"“Zeb” Orrelios is the last living Lasat, as far as most people know. Most galactic denizens are unaware of these large, powerful bipeds; those who are aware believe the entire species wiped out by the Empire after they protested the Emperor’s actions. What even fewer know is that Lasan wasn’t the actual Lasat homeworld, only the world most Lasat lived on. Zen was a member of the Lasan Honor Guard, armed with one of its signature b-rifles and charged with protecting its royal family and populace. That he was unable to do so continually drives his hatred for the Empire, and led to his joining Hera Syndulla’s crew.\n\nZeb often provides the key muscle and firepower a mission needs, but the others can overlook the tactical combat skills given his rough nature. He was also instrumental in rediscovering the true Lasat homeworld of Lira San, buried deep in Wild Space. Seeing a thriving Lasat populace here drives him to fight agains the Empire even harder. Now he is defending his people, instead of avenging them."}},"items":[{"_id":"5C1h6bbLfSez9FD0","name":"Bo-rifle ranged","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Cumbersome 3, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"J41zRjmata7MpZZ0","name":"Bo-rifle melee","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Cumbersome 3, Defensive 1, Disorient 2, Knockdown, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"YGDnUAMH15G2F5r4","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6fDZvU2806FLcucj","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"3RRJCaojgxjmbxsS","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
