{"_id":"rCXTaK2qvk8ztJ0N","name":"Chieftain Vera Beroya","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Vera became clan leader two years ago, when her father was killed (or so some think) defending the Talz from Zygerrian slavers. At twenty-eight years of age, Vera has led Mandalorians into combat countless times and has earned their respect for her tactical mind and combat prowess. Decisive and confident on the battlefield, Vera is less sure of herself in her new role as civic leader. She agonises over decisions that affect her entire clan. She relishes every chance she has to go to battle, and still leads her clan from the front.\n\nAn imposing figure, Vera is a tall, muscular woman with the powerful build of a human who has dedicated her entire life to warfare. She carries a light repeating blaster into combat, and when her ammo runs out—and it always does—she drops her weapon and charges to the very front lines. Screaming the entire time, she swings a massive mythosaur axe that belonged to her father, destroying everything in her path like a Mandalorian berserker of legend."}},"items":[{"_id":"FvGsvvHHfnc198oT","name":"SHUKOR-05 Light repeater","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Cumbersome 4, Inaccurate 1, Pierce 2, Autofire, Slow Firing 2"}},{"_id":"DxWgGXTRNTFy5PJY","name":"Mythosaur axe","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Cortosis, Pierce 3, Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"Oa7paUqUrBc1Rpe4","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"2U3njjdhIXvSMPeI","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ZIRe61QtTlj37uyk","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
