{"_id":"rEeiguGGJQ8r6b0z","name":"Alliance Infantry","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The rank-and-file of the Rebel Alliance’s Army and Naval troopers are not that much different from their Imperial counterparts, all things considered. They are trained in a number of different arenas and in various contingencies, and they are assigned in similarly organized military units. Even their equipment tends to be similar, although the Imperials generally have an advantage in that area. What separates them is motivation. The troops who serve the Alliance believe that they are not just fighting for their own well-being, but that of their families and innocent people all across the galaxy. This conviction is what the Alliance believes will allow them to ultimately win the day."}},"items":[{"_id":"JY4mrFHzxIdgIWwN","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"5pXDz63g7fEaetFy","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
