{"_id":"t2E3RWMMzFSkRnpK","name":"Murderous Fugitive","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Without the benefit of Jedi training, some Force-sensitive individuals who might otherwise have been able to control their abilities are left confused and overwhelmed. They find delight in murder and inflicting pain, especially when using their Force-sensitivity to fuel their urges. Often hunted for these crimes, these individuals are extremely dangerous to everyone they encounter."}},"items":[{"_id":"XNfmONr5AE0wIRLS","name":"Serrated vibroknife","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"xROS6WX26SK9JLJj","name":"Unleash","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":4,"range":"Short","skill":"Discipline","qualities":""}},{"_id":"HygVtFz1XDHV3Ase","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ylxm7sEtE2tD6TrJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"CVcjy1kyqPYi43gk","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"t5NNebmd5OXJvHXI","name":"Major Jex Karvek – Commando Raider","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"A veteran of Crix Madine’s original Storm Commando unit, Major Karvek has spent nearly his entire career within the Imperial special forces. Karvek grew up on the frontier of the Outer Rim. His rustic upbringing, like that of many of his enemies in the Rebellion, fostered a strong sense of independence. Karvek fully embraces the Storm Commando’s purpose: to fight fire with fire by employing asymmetric tactics against the Rebel Alliance. But Major Karvek takes this doctrine a step further than simply replicating guerrilla tactics. He sees the value that the Rebel’s use of individual initiative brings to the battlefield, and thus demands that of his 909th Detachment commandos.\n\n909th Storm Commando Detachment\n\nNormally dispatched on deliberate operations or attached to other forces in a platoon, or even squad sized elements, it is rare to see an entire Storm Commando detachment conduct missions under their organic chain of command. Major Karvek’s detachment, the 909th, is an exception to this rule. When mission success is demanded under extreme circumstances, but when the deployment of mass numbers of conventional forces proves undesirable, the 909th is dispatched to do with a company what would be expected of a regiment. Karvek’s commandos are highly trained and capable of operating on their own initiative, making this detachment ready for anything."}},"items":[{"_id":"BmF68yf8drfqv4Dl","name":"Blaster rifle with foregrip and sling","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":3,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Stun, Forearm Grip, Weapon Sling, Quick Draw"}},{"_id":"F6HRXQ6OudgB89CT","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"WbXRABAEIzBMqumK","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"Ua1ECTbQCUrHYJiI","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"mjKuvwb80MNjO3B2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"wkFjhs70jNfSICxM","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"t6OD1ZAdYDD3IbjT","name":"Hutt Slave Dealer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"There are few races in the galaxy as hated amd feared as the Hutts. These massive bneings have a stranglehold on the criminal underworld in the Outer Rim. Hutt slave dealers are particularly despised by most decent peoples for their traffic in sentient life. Generally surrounded by lackeys and bodyguards, Hutt slave dealers are formidable opponents, and their incredibly potent wills make them nearly immune to Force powers."}},"items":[{"_id":"eYD71pnGmsbylV8v","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"QtrgWNX45lbsoC0W","name":"Large-bore laster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":9,"critical":2,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"G8mAd8o8eJObPS6Z","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"lkSOW1vDxV2AUe5G","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
