{"_id":"tC6VRhqABlJ7HWSo","name":"Tusken Raider Chieftain","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Tusken Raider Chieftains lead whole tribes of Sand People - holding their position not through wisdom, but through brute savagery. Governing their clans through force and intimidation, the Chieftain is rarely encountered outside of their current campsite – instead feeding off the efforts of their Tusken Raider underlings and living in relative luxury. Less consummate stalkers than the Tusken Raider Huntsman, they are nonetheless a force to be reckoned with in combat.\n\nThe Chieftain represented here has claimed an advanced hunting rifle as a trophy (pillaged from an unlucky settler), but his real strength is in melee. In close quarters the Tusken Raider Chieftain is able to bring his vicious strength to bear, relying on his “Frenzied Attack” and “Feral Strength” talents.\n\nTravelers on who are captured by Tusken Raiders may awaken to find themselves in a Tusken Raider campsite, bound and at the mercy of a Tusken Raider Chieftain. There is little hope in reasoning with these barbaric figures – often a captive’s only hope is the timely intervention of a well-armed rescue party."}},"items":[{"_id":"gxO7sqd4Z0AAxtFc","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"sHniZXFPIjvLNONu","name":"Mark V “Sand Panther” hunting rifle","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":5,"range":"Long","skill":"Ranged: Heavy","qualities":"Accurate 1, Cumbersome 2, Superior, Sniper Shot"}},{"_id":"plJaZ3q1qpx6p6Yg","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"rbUOMGqxOXV3GYRO","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"JVJL2KNTskLHoNVs","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"5y9wdEZlIqvIcQ5G","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"rwhuRE1zqpwNXpEq","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
