{"_id":"tJSpycLI5poj8rdR","name":"Cybernetically-Enhanced Nexu","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The cyber-nexu are examples of Cratala’s handiwork. They are not under her control, but she has increased their natural territorial instincts and centred them on the starship. The cyborgs are meant to destroy anyone discovering and searching the *Sa Nalaor*."}},"items":[{"_id":"FFygH3kYZDhKwHmt","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}},{"_id":"58Gdkjsyngo5XvkL","name":"Bite","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":7,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 1, Pierce 1"}},{"_id":"vhRHQpLkw6lTeLOg","name":"Tail whip","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"tKw5J4IZj9jtlgBL","name":"Sorority Engineer","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Sorority’s engineers maintain their ships’ systems and ensure they remain functional even under the most trying conditions. They’re well aware that their own survival hinges on whether they can repair enough of theur ship’s systems for it to either flee or compete with their attackers. The engineers on the *Renegade’s Blood* consist of two humans (one male, one female), a male Sullustan, and a female Duros. They wear coveralls, utility belts festooned with tools, and breath masks. Two of them have blaster pistols, while the other two engineers wield heavy hydrospanners. If forced into combat, they fight in two groups, one with the pistols and the others with the hydrospanners."}},"items":[{"_id":"ekjRYCYayuwNkz3v","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"oH622ocbrMttcwQW","name":"Heavy hydrospanner","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"4","critical":"5","range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Disorient 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"tLjLB6IgiLy1mMHa","name":"Force Power: Foresee","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Spend :forcepip: to gain vague hints of events to come, up to a day into own future. Spend :forcepip: to increase the number of days seen into future by 2. Spend :forcepip: to gain more specific details."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"tMQKik4J66XSMNdG","name":"Light-Sensitive","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Defel are vulnerable to bright lights, which cause them intense pain and temporary blindness if v1ewed without protection. A Defel exposed to bright light without protective goggles suffers :setback::setback: on all skill checks."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
