{"_id":"u9XgBbCgkXz0p2pO","name":"IT-O Interrogation Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"One of the droids most commonly encountered in Imperial detention facilities is the IT-O, a spherical black interrogation droid studded with sensors and surgical tools. Most often accompanied by two navy troopers, the IT-O is an expert at forcibly convincing prisoners to talk."}},"items":[{"_id":"yYxaMrx31cB9MeDB","name":"Laser scalpel","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"u9km544kTt1CThKT","name":"Frightening Visage","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"As an ac­tion, may make an opposed Deception check vs. Vigilance (when multiple opponents are present, the best Vigilance skill determines difficulty) to create illusion of greater size and threat. If the snowfeather succeeds, all opponents present must make a :hard: fear check. Force-sensitive characters add :setback: to the fear check; droids and other characters immune to Force powers automatically pass the check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uBsO4a0ClXsQCIVJ","name":"Pirate Captain","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Among the rank-and-file of pirate crewmen, few survive long enough to practice their skills and become leaders among their fellows. These individuals possess a cunning that their comrades lack, a cunning which has been honed to a razor’s edge over the course of their careers. The ideology of these individuals varies, from those who slaughter every victim to avoid witnesses, to those who show mercy to their victims in the hopes of building a benevolent reputation to any ship captain who surrenders without a fight. Most pirate captains fear capture, and will not take unnecessary risks unless the promise of their bounty is so great that their avarice overcomes their cowardice."}},"items":[{"_id":"RGwwLdcw3lVR2ELm","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"nxxgJdHnyMdXuLhb","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"82MhTvvPFrqQldRh","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"FYdO3X24pLcP1i7i","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"mbGwIRH9EBfGJdJx","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uCdbOdY3MSXcQP6S","name":"Tam Blackstar","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"2RANlthIwl2GGR0O","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"H5GeDCDtrS6f8Qm9","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uI39rcnPbBhBnWSg","name":"Bloodfly","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Bloodflies are swarming insects common to the broad plains of Lothal. Large and highly aggressive, they measure between ten and fourteen millimeters long. They have banded, black-and-white bodies; iridescent wings; and huge, bright green eyes. As their name suggests, bloodflies feed on mammal blood, although they also ingest pollen and nectar. They tend to gather around herds of large animals such as nerfs, where the food is plentiful.\n\nWhile they have an extremely painful bite, they are also extremely noisy flyers, which makes them, at least for sentients, relatively a easy to avoid. Bloodflies occasionally carry a blood-borne disease called “bloodfly sickness”, which saps afflicted sentients’ strength and energy and causes fever, vomiting, and painful rashes. Thankfully, this disease is easily treated with bacta immersion and rest."}},"items":[{"_id":"jdzDFWFBth6n02qk","name":"Mandibles","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":2,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 4, Vicious 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uIe9cI9t6Z6tTrKc","name":"Ponderous (Thalassian)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Without their repulsor packs Thalassians can never spend more than one maneuver moving per turn."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uOtW8kw4YkUHQ1E0","name":"B1 Battle Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The original batlte droids—which fought for the Trade Federation on Naboo in what some now see as the prelude to the Clone Wars—have largely been replaced. CIS leadership deemed their networked control centres too much of a vulnerability, and newer B1 battle droids are fully capable of extended independent operation. However, the mass-produced armies of battle droids are created to provide abundant fire-power rather than clever tactics, so most commanders keep as light a rein on the droids in their service as they can manage.\n\nNewer clone troopers sometimes dismiss the basic “clankers” as an insignificant threat after taking out isolated patrols by surprise or coordinated assault, but this is an attitude that soon gets weeded out of them. Large numbers of the droids under a competent commander can be a grave threat, due to both the sheer volume of blaster fire and the ease with which the units coordinate their operations when a clear plan is in place."}},"items":[{"_id":"7rBVWnChiFBqy0Dk","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uQskjQqlfYKGODii","name":"Beast Rider Warrior","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"fTO8mGEgXLZgEJGM","name":"Hunting spear","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"pierce 1"}},{"_id":"Jtt1FRAF59LC2M2s","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uQzW5Gg67kdoCiI2","name":"Inquisitor lightsaber","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uRny2sBVHbgmQbEK","name":"Patrician Vilola Sargan","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The patrician of the Sargan family. Vilola is one of the major voices in the Clan Assembly. Vilola was Jans Coorsa’s sister-in-law, a fact she uses to wield influence over Kal, claiming to know what Jans would do or want in any given situation. Vilola has contacts throughout the criminal underworld. including among the Hutts, the Zann Consortium, and the Car’das smuggling ring. She uses her position to arrange favourable deals for her criminal contacts while enriching herself. When the time is right, she hopes to oust Kal Coorsa and take over as cacique. She has quietly set Kal and Lira Hardin against each other to remove the threat of a political alliance between their families, all the while secretly allying with Hardin over their shared reluctance to work with the Rebel Alliance."}},"items":[{"_id":"zwmj9DmJUdRph6EJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"PZXTbs0FEiYGLtQR","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uSJrwjCkLKTlQ8ir","name":"Huttlet","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When a newborn Hutt is comes into the world, the parent keeps the offspring in a pouch inside its body, where it nourishes the youngling. These infant Hutts often remain in their parent’s pouch for up to fifty standard years before emerging. While many would consider this a lifetime, for a species that can live for a thousand years, this is no time at all. Newly-emerged Hutts are considered juveniles at fifty years of age."}},"items":[{"_id":"XEFoSgIBP5bvwsSR","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uTFPSC7KRzyQj6Qh","name":"Soaring Accipiptero","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"These large, birdlike reptavians are the unchallenged kings of Dagobah’s jungle canopy. Accipipteros spend their entire lives in the branches of the gnarltrees that cover the planet’s swamps. They feast on bogwings and any other creature that climbs or soars to the top of, or above, the grasping trees. The accipipteros’ lower jaws end in a wicked hook, which they use to snare prey; they then maneuver the hapless creatures into their mouths with the small clawed hands on their wings. Once ensnared, the prey is eaten alive."}},"items":[{"_id":"h3SAKO0BQVMZl9oG","name":"Hooked jaw","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":6,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 2"}},{"_id":"rlqHZUnruQAUUYzZ","name":"Clawed hands","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uVSPHKVRyS9XrHH1","name":"Derrown","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"vzWWgPXBMYVg9io4","name":"Shoulder-mounted light repeating blaster","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"8","critical":"3","range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Auto-Fire, Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"OvkznFNhrBtOmMCq","name":"Tentacles","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"2","critical":"4","range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Disorient 2, Stun 4"}},{"_id":"9BGUWNvG81VdiA0q","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"oKyOcxljk27eQ19b","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
