{"_id":"uWphYXwIhrPFTPmZ","name":"Ronto","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Often seen as beasts of burden and mounts for Jawas, rontos are known to be effective, if skittish, mounts. Found on many worlds, including Nubia, Tatooine, and Kashyyyk, rontos are often employed away from populated areas, to reduce contact with technologies that might spook the beasts. Even so, they remain a common sight in many of Tatooine’s spaceports, and those who work with these animals place great stock in their loyalty."}},"items":[{"_id":"yqHa5CLIsyxGOexs","name":"Trampling hooves","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":12,"critical":4,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Knockdown"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"uXawSgrKTQLIxiZe","name":"Pong Krell","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"afg87HGzSFyY3yx9","name":"Krell’s Dual Double-Bladed Lightsabers","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":"9","critical":"2","range":"Engaged","skill":"Lightsaber","qualities":"Breach 1, Defensive 1, Deflection 1, Linked 1, Sunder, Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"CPx3rODRu1HzU4nf","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"pc7Yab6kp23oOLtT","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"hAusf0HxiQZhnHDC","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6a2PMy98sqyspJ8c","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"876G9UauGEZkXgZa","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"j1uJojWcjn4WOmMc","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"ucGtF3DQRd8RMdV9","name":"S-43 Enforcer Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Separatists are not the only manufacturers of combat droids in the galaxy. A small consortium of Hutts have begun development on their own line of “enforcer droids” to help defend their holdings amid growing galactic instability—and to help them seize more territory where they can manage. The S-43 enforcer droids are based on stolen Separatist plans for battle droids, but they have undergone a number of adjustments to better suit their manufacturers’ interests. Since the enforcer droids are regularly deployed against underworld lowlifes and negligent debtors, the Hutts have skimped on reinforcement for the the droids’ chassis as an unnecessary cost, making them more fragile than even basic B1 battle droids. However, the droids are equipped with upgraded processors designed to help them deal with the trickery and deception common to their operations, as well as integrated weaponry so that they can never be disarmed. Even given the consortium’s attempts to save costs where possible, the enforcer droid project has been a considerable investment. Nevertheless, it has already begun to pay dividends, as orders of the droids pout in from crime lords across the galaxy."}},"items":[{"_id":"XsN2PITwxurcri7W","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"xrLc4A7GESPJIrl4","name":"Integrated vibroblade","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":2,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2, Vicious 1"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"udhX8sLtiFhYlZel","name":"Discredit","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per encounter as an action, make a :hard: Deception check to make one character upgrade the difficulty of social checks once, and one additional time for every :advantage::advantage:."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
