{"_id":"v1lnJBtyF9t22NXm","name":"Yav Yiyar","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Yav Yiyar is number three in the Yiyar clan hierarchy, and number two in Yiyar Salvage. He captains the *Nightflyer* and is an excellent advance salvage scout. He leads by example, and his approach to any given situation is mirrored by those Yiyar clan members with him.\n\nUnfortunately, Yav is rude, crude, and generally horrible to his allies and everyone else. Yav is very excited about the *Sa Nalaor*, and he takes every advantage and opportunity he thinks he can get away with to find the ship first. Successfully locating and securing the *Sa Nalaor* could promote Yav to number two in the Yiyar clan hierarchy and give him command of Yiyar Salvage. He also dreams of depriving the hated IsoTech of its prize."}},"items":[{"_id":"aWLs6TncMBn4OZzc","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"svbRaRatMHjfXT8H","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"BZ16pDpX9nmds1rg","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
