{"_id":"vrVCmmuhQmxMF4Rp","name":"Lurking Scrange","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The scrange is Dagobah’s apex predator, an eight-metre-long reptilian nightmare with a powerful beaked mouth and two enormous clawed hands. The scrange looks like a large knobby lizard with bioluminescent bumps on its back, arranged in a ridge that travels the length of its spine. Instead of two hind legs, the scrange has six crustacean-like limbs it uses to skitter through swamp and over land in quick bursts. Its long tail ends in a set of four bony spikes, perfect for impaling prey.\n\nThe scrange prefers to lure unwary prey close, using its bioluminescence or its ability to camouflage itself as a log or piece of debris. When a creature moves within range, the scrange strikes. Death is usually swift."}},"items":[{"_id":"sWRXqddo9Z36QGtp","name":"Beaked mouth","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":12,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Ensnare 2"}},{"_id":"28dSfdYgvU8i8oiN","name":"Triangular claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3"}},{"_id":"hEsTJGysqsdS6QKh","name":"Tail spikes","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Vicious 3"}},{"_id":"kG6VVKQVXTOeYmj6","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"6WWH1sR6HykjONkI","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
