{"_id":"w4CYhypXhXI9BUNn","name":"Stand Firm","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per encounter, the character may take the Stand Firm action, making a :hard: Leadership check. If the check is successful, the character chooses one ally within Medium range for each :success: on the check. Until the end of the encounter, chosen allies increase their wound threshold by an amount equal to the character's Presence rating. (Multiple uses of this talent are not cumulative)."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"w5bsZm2Dwo0yaFIQ","name":"Computer Affinity","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Intrusion Specialist may add :force: to any Computers check or Skulduggery check to analyse or infiltrate a security system. Spend :forcepip: to add :advantage: to the check. Spend :forcepip::forcepip: to add :success: to any Computers check."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"w6hOg0aVcaQMbBBz","name":"Devlikk","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The long-necked Devlikk are an avian species native to Ord Radama. The diminutive species has green feathers around their shoulders, flat heads crowned with plumage, and small green tails. The Devlikk have short life spans, only living for nine to ten years."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"w7Qw9a06kzdznFAJ","name":"Reflect (Improved)","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"When struck by a ranged attack but before apply­ing Soak, suffer 3 Strain to reduce damage by {ranks|plus-2}. When reflecting a hit that generated :despair: or :threat::threat::threat:, may hit one target within Medium range dealing the same damage as the initial attack, after the original attack is resolved."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"w7rsyi2r00ZfM17r","name":"For Mandalore!","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Once per session, when Vizsla has exceeded his wound threshold but before he is incapacitated, he may make one out-of-turn attack against a target he is Engaged with."}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"wARXIlBDc4oIihCE","name":"Senator","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Denizens of the Core Worlds include former members of the Imperial Senate, recently disbanded by the Emperor, who remain in the area in hopes of maintaining their political influence, wealthy lifestyle, and general connection to the goings-on of the Empire as a whole. Under normal circumstances, these individuals venture into the more rural regions of the galaxy only very rarely. Even those who represent the Outer Rim Territories can scarcely find time for such a lengthy journey. When such individuals do venture out into the galaxy at large, it is typically to serve their own needs rather than the needs of anyone else. A rare few are genuinely interested in the fate of their constituents and seek to aid the Alliance in restoring a more compassionate government, but most have benefited far too much from their association with the Empire to willingly aid in its overthrow."}},"items":[{"_id":"9i7ZigWweBfEHHC2","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"FeR2I941pkW0MKkd","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ZfJklKIqXWTwTXoz","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
