{"_id":"wFoq7kMQh7b6iwai","name":"Black Marketeer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"In any conflict the size and scope of the Galactic Civil War, there are always those who seek to profit from the struggle. In this case, the Rebel Alliance’s desperate need for arms and supplies has made a great many people very wealthy, indeed. Black Marketeers are those who have a particular knack for acquiring things that people need, usually people with large amounts of credits to spend in acquiring them. They most frequently deal with the Alliance, since the Empire scarcely wants for supplies, but individual members of the Empire may be corrupt enough to deal with such individuals if it suits their needs to do so."}},"items":[{"_id":"1VQkZTnE8FGg4ta2","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"l4gFWUDEaZDxLfUU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
