{"_id":"y7a3yFxELIbMmfHx","name":"Spaceport Overseer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"In the grand scheme of galactic travel and trade, an individual spaceport is rarely something of consequence. Indeed, many traders and travelers see dozens or hundreds of them over the course of a single year, perhaps even a single month. Each individual spaceport has its own administrator, a single being whose sole purpose is to ensure the safe and efficient operation of that particular port of call. These men and women frequently operate under a shared common code of regulations determined by the Empire, but they might also have individual sector, system, planetary, or even personal regulations that they are inclined to observe. This makes each visit at a particular spaceport a unique experience. Regardless of their quirks, most are bureaucrats and cogs in the Imperial machine, but some still have the wherewithal to place their covert support behind the Rebel Alliance."}},"items":[{"_id":"kcdDapZAE6lK9MRQ","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
