{"_id":"yrs1uU7jMMC0AodP","name":"Buzz Droid","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Technically known as Pistoeka sabotage droids, these diminutive machines seem more like animate munitions than actual members of the droid army. Typically deployed out of discord missiles or similar dispersal mechanisms, buzz droids are released to tear apart enemy vehicles such as starfighters and transports. Although they are individually little threat even to a lightly armoured fighter, a swarm of buzz droids can quickly strip a ship of its plating and begin tearing apart vital systems. Removing buzz droids from a ship usually requires daredevil piloting or intervention from other droids serving aboard the vessel, such as a fighter’s astromech co-pilot, as a pilot can hardly spare the attention to deal with the droids directly while mid-flight. Despite their destructive capabilities, buzz droids are little threat to combatants who find a way to confront them. The armaments are specialised tools, rather than true weapons, and they have little to nothing in the way of armour or redundant systems, as the CIS manufacturers designed them to be disposable weapons."}},"items":[{"_id":"YmKzJ7qr7LYSnGa2","name":"Integrated saws and drills","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":"Pierce 2"}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"yrsLKL3NCt4QVgi5","name":"Clone Medical Officer","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[{"_id":"U5sgkVUekTvw1egK","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"XieNkyHzRl7nI2sH","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"yvfmoEe6t4ZhDw2c","name":"Smuggler","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Smugglers are often romanticized in underground holovids as heroes and rogues whose dashing and courage often places them in harm’s way against opponents whose vices and crimes far outstrip their own. There are a handful of such individuals in the galaxy, to be sure, but the vast majority of smugglers are greedy and amoral individuals who seek to profit by flaunting both law and tradition. The only true commonality among smugglers is a healthy disrespect for the forces of law and order. This often places them in a position to be of benefit to the Rebel Alliance, although the Alliance is often understandably reluctant to place its trust in such individuals. Indeed, when one considers that smugglers often risk crossing ruthless, murderous crime lords, the probability that they will consider deceiving and double-crossing the Alliance is equally high."}},"items":[{"_id":"U5FucXcwzBOQPSkt","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"yykeZjMYGJ6CsIvq","name":"Cadet Wedge Antilles","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Wedge Antilles, a talented human pilot from Corellia, displayed superior skills that earned him a slot as a cadet at Skystrike Academy. Even at that time, his devotion to the Imperial cause was limited due to the suffering of his friends and family under the Galactic Empire. In the wake of an Imperial massacre near Teralov, Wedge and several other Skystrike cadets contacted a Rebel operative about defecting. In response, Phoenix Cell infiltrated the academy and escaped with the sympathisers, though one died in the process. The survivors joined the resistance movement as pilots, where their skills will surely be of great use against the Empire and its creations in coming battles."}},"items":[{"_id":"7c9ltYhc75Fjw6Ly","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"2eY25yFKGvyNAVFP","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"yzA20wWU127gpGlB","name":"Shalo Sherin","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Shalo is a tall, moderately handsome human with grey hair, blue eyes, and a penchant for stylish cloth ing. He has an air of authority about him that catches most individuals off guard, and his servants and staff are loyal to him to a fault. Despite his personable demeanor, he is completely amoral and willing to sacrifice anyone to accomplish his goals.\n\nShalo is always accompanied by Therah Yunin, his Twi’lek concubine, and the occasion of the Granee Noopa is no exception. For her part, Therah feels deeply indebted to Shalo for something he did for her many years ago and helps him with his schemes as a result, but she is under no illusions that the callous noble will ever change. She uses the Twi’lek Dancer profile on page 414 of the E dge of the Empire Core Rulebook."}},"items":[{"_id":"ixEGusNxoDK9juM3","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"LnB3rbmPnW4pH0yJ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"34PcMOrrpMWGLryZ","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"K68gJidHXnpRF8yz","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"z0QlyrmG1h7f8ppB","name":"Deft Maker","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":""}},"items":[],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"z2BLzYmYgIhqBkac","name":"Survivor","type":"minion","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The *Sa Nalaor* crew and survivors are a diverse mix of species including Arkanians, Aqualish, Gossams, Twi’leks, humans, and more. They range in age from the late forties on up. The survivors are divided as to Harsol’s leadership. Some survivors are bitter to have been trapped on Cholganna for so long and fear Captain Harsol, while others are satisfied to be bneyond the reach of the Empire and forgotten by the galaxy. A few have tried to mutiny, albeit unsuccessfully. They “disappeared” soon after the failed coup attempt."}},"items":[{"_id":"vSkQ8m97JzFmf0lP","name":"Worn-out blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":4,"critical":6,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"sDjslB36YsbAVsPx","name":"Combat knife","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":3,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Melee","qualities":""}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"z2kY9HJDZv74ShoF","name":"Assassin Droid","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Assassin droids embody the worst fears organic beings have of mechanical life—specifically that it will employ violence against its creators in an attempt to replace them. While assassin droids are not so universally genocidal in their function, they are designed with the intent to kill living creatures. As such, they are a constant danger to all who interact with them, as they are motivated not by profit or ideology, but by pure, programmed instinct. Officially, of course, the Imperials do not employ assassin droids, which are illegal in virtually every sector of the galaxy. Unofficially, the Empire employs them discreetly to seek out specific targets that are impossible, or at least inconvenient, for them to deal with personally. On general principle, the Alliance eschews assassin droids completely."}},"items":[{"_id":"yLtj3R6aevkCDjmb","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"C1ykucRXYstqfZZx","name":"Built-in light blaster pistol","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":5,"critical":4,"range":"Medium","skill":"Ranged: Light","qualities":"Stun Setting"}},{"_id":"xAzZ8407RdsJG0xD","name":"Built-in missile tube","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":20,"critical":2,"range":"Extreme","skill":"Gunnery","qualities":"Blast 10, Cumbersome 3, Guided 3, Breach 1, Limited Ammo 6"}},{"_id":"hj1PGp6Oi2dFWADT","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"ukAovSa0chakMsNe","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"4jxdeEHYgidBqV3y","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
