{"_id":"zQwhaxgeSJzGNWpj","name":"Leia Organa","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"The Alderaanian princess is already well known to be as out-spoken and politically savvy as her famous father. Although she is very young to hold a position of power as great as that of an Imperial Senator, she has had a lifetime of training for the role. She embodies all of Alderaan’s values and strengths, along with Bail Organa’s political skill and desire to bring an end to the Emperor and Empire. She actively users her diplomatic status to support resistance activities, whether for recruitment, acquisition of supplies, delivery of information, or even to personally join a fight when necessary."}},"items":[{"_id":"I7Pszf8feNgdHyFe","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"hRdyRFNMDOsdANA6","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"JEKIf0Q8XmHIRjYo","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"xwKkhLK5neA5eMex","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"zpJ4PVm5AvvUt4fE","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"zSeMTmnduPQzgWl3","name":"Wampa","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Wampas are the fearsome alpha predators of Hoth. Their shaggy white hair allows these vicious creatures to perfectly blend with Hoth’s snowy landscape so they can sneak up on their prey undetected. Wampas typically dwell in ice caverns formed by underground hot springs nestled within the tundra, venturing out into the open only when hunting for food. Wampas subsist primarily on tauntauns, and they display a surprising degree of intelligence when stalking their prey. Unlike most carnivores, wampas prefer to capture their prey alive and dangle their future meal from the ceiling of their lair until they are ready to dine on fresh meat."}},"items":[{"_id":"iihekrVBLRSrFiCs","name":"Claws","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":8,"critical":3,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Brawl","qualities":"Pierce 3, Vicious 2"}},{"_id":"GPTVspODMxYxqPoU","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"zT5xBii6cVINBjnu","name":"Ryder Azadi","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"characteristics":{"brawn":{"value":2},"agility":{"value":2},"intellect":{"value":2},"cunning":{"value":2},"willpower":{"value":2},"presence":{"value":2}},"stats":{"wounds":{"value":0,"max":10},"strain":{"value":0,"max":10},"soak":{"value":0},"defence":{"melee":0,"ranged":0}},"biography":{"description":"Ryder Azadi was the previous Governor of Lothal, but his support for anti-Imperial broadcasts (and the machinations of Arihnda Pryce) led to his arrest and imprisonment. He managed to escape years later, and now is one of the main leaders of Lothal’s rising resistance efforts to thwart the Empire’s occupation through industrial sabotage and skirmish attacks."}},"items":[{"_id":"HUV3nfD2RuML8jpL","name":"Weapon","type":"weapon","system":{"damage":0,"critical":0,"range":"Engaged","skill":"Ranged-Light","qualities":""}},{"_id":"jABi7WmwJTSVIv1Y","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}},{"_id":"EpqBDLmJA3nzY8Sg","name":"Talent","type":"talent","system":{"description":"","activation":"Passive","tier":1,"ranked":false}}],"effects":[],"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0}}
